<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:05.239" end="00:00:07.500" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.300" end="00:00:10.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cece, my child, you&#39;re old enough to</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.500" end="00:00:10.000" style="s2">marry now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.900" end="00:00:25.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I choose none of them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.900" end="00:00:25.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.500" end="00:00:42.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be afraid. My blood can save you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.100" end="00:00:52.000" style="s2">From that day on, August took me in and</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.300" end="00:00:53.400" style="s2">promised I could choose one of his five</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.000" end="00:00:54.800" style="s2">sons to marry.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.400" end="00:00:55.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a little sister now. I&#39;ll protect</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.800" end="00:00:57.100" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.700" end="00:00:58.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For a while I thought I&#39;d finally found</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.100" end="00:01:00.000" style="s2">a real family,</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.500" end="00:01:01.400" style="s2">but it didn&#39;t last.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.000" end="00:01:04.600" style="s2">An enemy [laughter] of the Sangui family</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.400" end="00:01:04.600" style="s2">hired a witch to curse them.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.000" end="00:01:13.300" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t stand by and watch them turn</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.600" end="00:01:15.300" style="s2">into beasts.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.300" end="00:01:17.600" style="s2">So I made a deal with a demon to save</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.300" end="00:01:17.600" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.000" end="00:01:28.100" style="s2">I, Selene Meredy, offer you a pact.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.900" end="00:01:29.700" style="s2">Break their curse and give them back</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.100" end="00:01:32.500" style="s2">their human forms and I&#39;ll pay whatever</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.700" end="00:01:32.500" style="s2">price you ask.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.300" end="00:01:39.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want those pure, sacred eyes of yours.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.100" end="00:01:40.500" style="s2">So,</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.300" end="00:01:43.800" style="s2">do you accept?</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.500" end="00:01:44.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, don&#39;t agree to it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.800" end="00:01:46.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I accept.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.600" end="00:01:47.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WE&#39;RE NOT WORTH YOUR EYES. PLEASE, CECE,</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.800" end="00:01:51.000" style="s2">WE&#39;LL FIND ANOTHER WAY.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.900" end="00:01:52.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T GIVE HIM ANYTHING.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.000" end="00:01:55.000" style="s2">NO.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.600" end="00:01:57.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OUR BARGAIN IS SEALED.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.000" end="00:01:59.200" style="s2">IF these five ever betray you, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.400" end="00:02:01.392" style="s2">return your eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.200" end="00:02:03.392" style="s2">The curse will rebound on The deeper</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.392" end="00:02:05.692" style="s2">they hurt you, the worse it gets. On the</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.392" end="00:02:09.092" style="s2">next lunar eclipse, they&#39;ll become bats</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.692" end="00:02:10.492" style="s2">and never take human form again.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.092" end="00:02:11.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cece,</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.492" end="00:02:14.392" style="s2">what have you done? You gave up your</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.992" end="00:02:15.992" style="s2">eyes for us.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.392" end="00:02:17.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We swear that from this day forward,</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.992" end="00:02:20.192" style="s2">we&#39;ll protect you forever and never let</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.692" end="00:02:23.492" style="s2">anyone hurt you. If we break this vow,</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.192" end="00:02:24.592" style="s2">may heaven strike us down.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.492" end="00:02:26.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cece,</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.592" end="00:02:28.392" style="s2">haven&#39;t you always loved Damian? And</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.592" end="00:02:29.992" style="s2">Damian loves you too.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.392" end="00:02:32.292" style="s2">Why won&#39;t you choose him?</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.992" end="00:02:34.192" style="s2">Did he do something to hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.292" end="00:02:36.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought so too</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.192" end="00:02:37.692" style="s2">until three days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.192" end="00:02:38.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cece,</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.692" end="00:02:41.092" style="s2">are you awake?</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.592" end="00:02:42.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whenever Damian wanted to surprise me,</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.092" end="00:02:45.492" style="s2">he&#39;d always whisper my name like that</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.892" end="00:02:45.492" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.792" end="00:02:49.692" style="s2">She&#39;s sleeping like a rock.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.592" end="00:02:51.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is Morgana here?</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.692" end="00:02:53.692" style="s2">She&#39;s just the new maid.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.892" end="00:02:55.792" style="s2">It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.692" end="00:02:58.792" style="s2">Damian&#39;s right beside me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.792" end="00:02:58.792" style="s2">I&#39;m safe with him.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.992" end="00:03:04.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if she wakes up? She can&#39;t see</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.092" end="00:03:06.192" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.192" end="00:03:07.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it down. If she finds out, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.192" end="00:03:09.492" style="s2">tell father and I don&#39;t need the old man</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.892" end="00:03:12.892" style="s2">giving Morgana trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.492" end="00:03:16.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, you&#39;re so sweet to me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.892" end="00:03:16.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My princess, I love you too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.892" end="00:03:20.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are they doing?</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.592" end="00:03:22.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about you, Damian? Aren&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.392" end="00:03:24.992" style="s2">supposed to be in love with Celine? I</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.292" end="00:03:27.192" style="s2">heard one of you is going to marry her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.992" end="00:03:30.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just one of them. I only need one of</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.192" end="00:03:32.992" style="s2">them to say no. Damian, say something.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.892" end="00:03:34.692" style="s2">Please, tell me this isn&#39;t real.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.992" end="00:03:36.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she hadn&#39;t saved us from father, I</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.692" end="00:03:37.392" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t even look twice at all like</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.492" end="00:03:38.492" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.392" end="00:03:40.092" style="s2">I never loved her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.492" end="00:03:43.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thinking about how I used to follow her</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.092" end="00:03:45.792" style="s2">around and kiss up to her makes me sick.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.192" end="00:03:46.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana, sweetheart, we&#39;ll always be</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.792" end="00:03:48.792" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.792" end="00:03:50.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to marry Lucian Knott.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.792" end="00:03:51.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucian Knott?</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.092" end="00:03:54.192" style="s2">Cece, the Knott family&#39;s Lucian never</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.992" end="00:03:56.492" style="s2">appears in public. They say he&#39;s lived</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.192" end="00:03:59.092" style="s2">for 500 years and was the only one to</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.492" end="00:04:01.692" style="s2">escape the vampire hunter&#39;s purge. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.092" end="00:04:03.494" style="s2">dangerous, mysterious.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.692" end="00:04:05.094" style="s2">If you marry him, I may not be able to</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.494" end="00:04:06.594" style="s2">protect you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.094" end="00:04:09.394" style="s2">Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.594" end="00:04:09.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve made up my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.994" end="00:04:12.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re certain, I&#39;ll send a letter to</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.594" end="00:04:15.494" style="s2">North Manor tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.994" end="00:04:15.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.107" end="00:04:18.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.794" end="00:04:20.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a step here. Careful, I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.594" end="00:04:22.394" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.394" end="00:04:24.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some habits don&#39;t disappear the moment</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.394" end="00:04:26.594" style="s2">you finally see someone for who they</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.294" end="00:04:28.294" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.594" end="00:04:30.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heads up!</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.294" end="00:04:31.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marcus, that&#39;s so mean. What if you hit</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.794" end="00:04:33.094" style="s2">someone?</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.494" end="00:04:34.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can&#39;t even see.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.094" end="00:04:35.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. She&#39;d probably think a bird</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.994" end="00:04:37.694" style="s2">flew by.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.794" end="00:04:39.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t let them know I can see again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.694" end="00:04:40.694" style="s2">If they find out, they&#39;ll know the</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.194" end="00:04:43.494" style="s2">demon&#39;s pact has already judged their</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.694" end="00:04:46.094" style="s2">betrayal. August isn&#39;t well. I can&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.494" end="00:04:48.694" style="s2">him learn the truth yet.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.094" end="00:04:51.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at that shot. Almost nailed it. Hey</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.694" end="00:04:53.794" style="s2">Celine, here&#39;s your chance. Catch!</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.394" end="00:04:56.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. Can&#39;t catch that either? Did going</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.794" end="00:04:57.794" style="s2">blind make you deaf too?</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.694" end="00:04:58.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you done?</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.794" end="00:04:59.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine,</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.794" end="00:05:01.494" style="s2">we were just trying to include you in</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.894" end="00:05:01.994" style="s2">the game. You&#39;re seriously mad about</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.494" end="00:05:03.694" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.994" end="00:05:06.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You almost hit me in the face.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.694" end="00:05:06.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you didn&#39;t get hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.198" end="00:05:10.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.694" end="00:05:11.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you all forgotten the vow you made?</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.594" end="00:05:13.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re holding that old favor over us</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.894" end="00:05:15.794" style="s2">again? Celine, haven&#39;t we treated you</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.794" end="00:05:17.294" style="s2">well enough all these years? Wasn&#39;t that</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.794" end="00:05:18.494" style="s2">enough to repay you for one pair of</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.294" end="00:05:20.694" style="s2">eyes?</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.494" end="00:05:21.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re immortal vampires. How long are we</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.694" end="00:05:23.094" style="s2">supposed to keep paying you back for</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.894" end="00:05:25.194" style="s2">your eyes?</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.094" end="00:05:27.894" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget, you chose to give them to</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.194" end="00:05:29.694" style="s2">the demon. No one forced you. So stop</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.894" end="00:05:31.194" style="s2">acting like a victim. We swear that from</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.694" end="00:05:33.494" style="s2">this day forward, we&#39;ll protect you</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.194" end="00:05:35.794" style="s2">forever and never let anyone hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.494" end="00:05:36.894" style="s2">If we break this vow, may heaven strike</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.794" end="00:05:39.294" style="s2">us down.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.894" end="00:05:41.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not trying to hold it over you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.294" end="00:05:43.094" style="s2">I &#39;m warning you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.294" end="00:05:44.594" style="s2">If you betray me, the demon&#39;s bargain</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.094" end="00:05:46.794" style="s2">will unravel and you&#39;ll turn into</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.594" end="00:05:48.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough!</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.794" end="00:05:51.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celine,</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.594" end="00:05:55.294" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry we upset you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.894" end="00:05:55.294" style="s2">I&#39;ll talk to the young masters.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.694" end="00:05:58.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine, did Father call you into the</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.294" end="00:06:00.094" style="s2">study to ask which one of us you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.794" end="00:06:02.694" style="s2">choosing as your husband?</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.094" end="00:06:04.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, so who did you pick?</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.694" end="00:06:05.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wonder which poor bastard drew the short</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.295" end="00:06:06.195" style="s2">straw.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.195" end="00:06:06.995" style="s2">Careful.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.195" end="00:06:08.395" style="s2">It could be you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.995" end="00:06:09.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celine,</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.395" end="00:06:11.295" style="s2">do you really think you&#39;re good enough</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.695" end="00:06:13.895" style="s2">for these five gentlemen?</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.295" end="00:06:15.495" style="s2">If I were you, I wouldn&#39;t choose anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.895" end="00:06:16.695" style="s2">I&#39;d hate to ruin a good man.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.495" end="00:06:17.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half-breed,</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.695" end="00:06:19.095" style="s2">who gave you permission to speak to me</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.939" end="00:06:20.495" style="s2">[music] like that?</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.095" end="00:06:22.195" style="s2">Play your sweet little act for them all</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.495" end="00:06:25.095" style="s2">you want, just don&#39;t bring that fake</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.195" end="00:06:25.095" style="s2">innocence to me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.144" end="00:06:29.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.395" end="00:06:30.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celine, I&#39;m so sorry. A half-breed</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.095" end="00:06:32.695" style="s2">like my has no right to be at Sanguini</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.695" end="00:06:34.695" style="s2">Manor. I&#39;ll leave on my own. Please,</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.695" end="00:06:36.295" style="s2">please don&#39;t kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.695" end="00:06:37.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you terrorizing her? This is</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.295" end="00:06:39.095" style="s2">Sanguinti land. Who gave you the right</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.695" end="00:06:40.095" style="s2">to throw your weight around here?</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.095" end="00:06:42.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She provoked me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.095" end="00:06:43.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine, I&#39;m warning you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.295" end="00:06:45.495" style="s2">Keep this up and none of us will ever</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.595" end="00:06:46.795" style="s2">agree to marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.495" end="00:06:48.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.795" end="00:06:50.595" style="s2">It won&#39;t be any of you five.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.895" end="00:06:52.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you pick me,</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.595" end="00:06:54.095" style="s2">I&#39;d rather die.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.595" end="00:06:56.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t say that.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.095" end="00:06:57.795" style="s2">Marcus, you&#39;ll hurt Miss Celine&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.095" end="00:06:59.295" style="s2">feelings.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.795" end="00:07:03.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll announce who I&#39;m marrying at the</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.295" end="00:07:03.195" style="s2">family council in seven days.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.754" end="00:07:07.774" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.895" end="00:07:11.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s obviously doing this to get my</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.195" end="00:07:12.895" style="s2">attention.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.195" end="00:07:14.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax, Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.895" end="00:07:18.095" style="s2">She gave up her eyes for us. There&#39;s no</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.695" end="00:07:18.095" style="s2">way she&#39;ll ever stop clinging to us.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.295" end="00:07:21.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.495" end="00:07:23.795" style="s2">Why am I devolving?</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.995" end="00:07:25.295" style="s2">What the hell?</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.795" end="00:07:27.895" style="s2">Was the blood we drank this afternoon</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.295" end="00:07:27.895" style="s2">spoiled?</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.300" end="00:07:34.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.695" end="00:07:34.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s fresh blood in the air.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.095" end="00:07:43.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.795" end="00:07:45.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celine, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.995" end="00:07:46.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a blood tracking sigil. If there</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.695" end="00:07:48.295" style="s2">are hunters anywhere nearby, they&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.895" end="00:07:50.095" style="s2">find us fast. You&#39;re going to get</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.295" end="00:07:51.395" style="s2">everyone in the Sanguini family killed.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.095" end="00:07:51.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How would a blind girl know what I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.395" end="00:07:54.595" style="s2">drawing?</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.995" end="00:07:56.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But fine. So what? You purebloods were</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.595" end="00:07:58.095" style="s2">born with everything and never even</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.195" end="00:07:59.595" style="s2">looked at half-breeds like us. Now I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.095" end="00:08:01.295" style="s2">going to show you how the precious saint</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.595" end="00:08:04.095" style="s2">they worship gets ground into the dirt</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.295" end="00:08:06.095" style="s2">by his own sons. There are dozens of</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.095" end="00:08:08.997" style="s2">innocent half-breeds in this castle. The</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.095" end="00:08:10.297" style="s2">stable hands, cooks, gardeners, maids.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.997" end="00:08:11.255" style="s2">If you bring hunters here, they&#39;ll die</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.297" end="00:08:11.697" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.255" end="00:08:13.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.697" end="00:08:15.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care. As long as all of you die,</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.897" end="00:08:19.197" style="s2">the Sangiri family will belong to the</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.497" end="00:08:19.197" style="s2">little plaything you all looked down on.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.997" end="00:08:26.197" style="s2">What on earth is Morgana trying TO DO?</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.975" end="00:08:29.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.297" end="00:08:31.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MISS CELINE, PLEASE DON&#39;T DO THIS. I</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.697" end="00:08:34.997" style="s2">DIDN&#39;T MEAN TO GET IN YOUR WAY. IF YOU</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.397" end="00:08:34.997" style="s2">HATE ME THAT MUCH, JUST KILL ME.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.145" end="00:08:38.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.297" end="00:08:40.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CELINE,</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.797" end="00:08:41.997" style="s2">HAVE YOU LOST YOUR MIND?</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.097" end="00:08:43.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I DIDN&#39;T hurt her.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.997" end="00:08:44.097" style="s2">I caught her drawing a blood tracking</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.297" end="00:08:45.297" style="s2">sigil.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.097" end="00:08:46.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.297" end="00:08:48.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a blood tracking sigil invented by</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.997" end="00:08:50.897" style="s2">vampire hunters. It&#39;s drawn with the</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.997" end="00:08:52.397" style="s2">caster&#39;s blood and can expose every</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.897" end="00:08:53.897" style="s2">vampire within 100 miles.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.397" end="00:08:55.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re blind. How would you know what</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.897" end="00:08:56.597" style="s2">she drew?</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.097" end="00:08:58.797" style="s2">You can&#39;t even see, so what gives you</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.597" end="00:09:00.397" style="s2">the right to accuse her? I bet you drew</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.797" end="00:09:01.497" style="s2">this creepy thing yourself and framed</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.397" end="00:09:03.097" style="s2">Morgana.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.497" end="00:09:04.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, Celine,</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.097" end="00:09:07.097" style="s2">maybe Miss Celine didn&#39;t mean it. She</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.997" end="00:09:09.797" style="s2">really can&#39;t see. I don&#39;t blame her. I</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.097" end="00:09:09.797" style="s2">really don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.997" end="00:09:12.897" style="s2">I could have told them I could see</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.097" end="00:09:14.697" style="s2">everything, but they wouldn&#39;t even look</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.897" end="00:09:15.897" style="s2">at the knife in Morgana&#39;s hand. Why</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.697" end="00:09:17.097" style="s2">would they ever look at the truth I</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.897" end="00:09:18.097" style="s2">showed them?</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.097" end="00:09:21.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did we</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.097" end="00:09:21.097" style="s2">accuse her for nothing?</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.197" end="00:09:24.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My arm hurts so so much. I feel like I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.097" end="00:09:28.597" style="s2">going to faint. Miss Celine must be</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.897" end="00:09:28.597" style="s2">furious with me. I SHOULD GO APOLOGIZE.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.097" end="00:09:34.097" style="s2">MISS CELINE, PLEASE FORGIVE ME. IT was</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.297" end="00:09:35.697" style="s2">all my fault. I shouldn&#39;t have gone over</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.097" end="00:09:37.716" style="s2">there. I shouldn&#39;t have let you see me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.697" end="00:09:38.597" style="s2">Please don&#39;t be angry with me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.716" end="00:09:40.597" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.597" end="00:09:42.297" style="s2">If you won&#39;t forgive me, I won&#39;t get up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.597" end="00:09:45.197" style="s2">I&#39;ll stay on my knees until you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.297" end="00:09:45.197" style="s2">angry anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.597" end="00:09:49.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough, Morgana. Stop pretending.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.797" end="00:09:56.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celine, please stop hurting me. I</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.497" end="00:09:56.497" style="s2">know I WAS WRONG.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.797" end="00:10:04.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FOR ONE stupid second, I actually</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.197" end="00:10:06.497" style="s2">thought he was going to help me up.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.597" end="00:10:08.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can you be this vicious?</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.497" end="00:10:09.997" style="s2">Morgana got on her knees and begged you,</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.397" end="00:10:11.898" style="s2">and you still hit her?</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.997" end="00:10:14.098" style="s2">Are you that insanely jealous of her?</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.898" end="00:10:15.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t lay a finger on her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.098" end="00:10:16.998" style="s2">She cut herself with the knife and</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.398" end="00:10:17.798" style="s2">through herself down the stairs. Can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.998" end="00:10:19.898" style="s2">you see that?</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.798" end="00:10:20.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All we see is you bullying her again and</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.898" end="00:10:22.798" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.598" end="00:10:24.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine, listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.798" end="00:10:26.898" style="s2">No man in this world would want a woman</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.298" end="00:10:28.098" style="s2">like you except the five of us.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.898" end="00:10:29.698" style="s2">We only bother treating you like a</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.098" end="00:10:31.398" style="s2">person because you saved father and</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.698" end="00:10:32.998" style="s2">broke our curse.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.398" end="00:10:35.098" style="s2">And that&#39;s still not enough for you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.998" end="00:10:36.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never asked for this engagement.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.098" end="00:10:38.298" style="s2">August offered it to me. I never begged</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.698" end="00:10:40.298" style="s2">any of you to marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.298" end="00:10:41.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There you go hiding behind father again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.298" end="00:10:42.998" style="s2">You saved his life once so our whole</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.898" end="00:10:45.298" style="s2">family is supposed to worship you</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.998" end="00:10:46.598" style="s2">forever. Enough, Celine. Say one more</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.298" end="00:10:47.798" style="s2">word and I&#39;ll go to father right now and</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.598" end="00:10:49.298" style="s2">have that engagement canceled.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.798" end="00:10:52.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.298" end="00:10:52.498" style="s2">I&#39;m not marrying any of you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.627" end="00:10:59.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.498" end="00:11:04.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why isn&#39;t she defending herself? She</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.998" end="00:11:04.998" style="s2">never used to be like this.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.198" end="00:11:08.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s an act.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.898" end="00:11:11.298" style="s2">She gave up her eyes for us. How could</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.998" end="00:11:12.298" style="s2">she not want to marry one of us?</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.298" end="00:11:13.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s just trying to make us feel</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.298" end="00:11:14.898" style="s2">guilty.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.098" end="00:11:16.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.898" end="00:11:19.498" style="s2">Who else would want her?</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.698" end="00:11:19.498" style="s2">She&#39;s blind.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.698" end="00:11:27.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, the Sanguinini family has</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.498" end="00:11:29.498" style="s2">replied. Miss Celine Moretti wishes to</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.398" end="00:11:32.598" style="s2">form a marriage alliance with you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.498" end="00:11:35.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine Morelli, it&#39;s her. She&#39;s finally</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.598" end="00:11:35.198" style="s2">grown up.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.898" end="00:11:39.398" style="s2">Send this to the Sanguinini family.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.198" end="00:11:42.098" style="s2">Tell them to prepare the wedding the</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.398" end="00:11:43.298" style="s2">moment the family council ends.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.098" end="00:11:45.198" style="s2">Until then,</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.298" end="00:11:46.398" style="s2">if anyone harms so much as a hair on her</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.198" end="00:11:48.198" style="s2">head,</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.398" end="00:11:50.698" style="s2">I&#39;ll collect that debt myself.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.198" end="00:11:52.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, master.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.698" end="00:11:54.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I remember correctly, she&#39;s the only</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.698" end="00:11:56.098" style="s2">vampire in centuries who isn&#39;t afraid of</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.698" end="00:11:58.598" style="s2">sunlight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.098" end="00:11:58.598" style="s2">Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.398" end="00:12:03.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There seems to be the smell of blood</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.698" end="00:12:03.198" style="s2">around here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.403" end="00:12:08.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.998" end="00:12:13.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mind your own business, blind girl. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.198" end="00:12:15.099" style="s2">hungry. We&#39;re too close to the city.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.299" end="00:12:18.599" style="s2">There could be hunters nearby. Killing</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.099" end="00:12:18.599" style="s2">someone here will expose our track.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.899" end="00:12:22.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you care?</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.299" end="00:12:32.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Selene is trying to kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.699" end="00:12:34.399" style="s2">SHE&#39;S GOING TO KILL ME OVER A HUMAN.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.899" end="00:12:35.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU PSYCHO.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.399" end="00:12:38.899" style="s2">She was hungry. You tried to kill her</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.899" end="00:12:38.899" style="s2">over some human?</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.499" end="00:12:42.699" style="s2">HUNTERS, RUN.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.999" end="00:12:54.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FOR ONE SECOND, I ACTUALLY THOUGHT HE&#39;D</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.099" end="00:12:55.899" style="s2">come back for me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.699" end="00:12:59.099" style="s2">Even then,</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.899" end="00:12:59.099" style="s2">I still believed in him.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.733" end="00:13:06.063" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.699" end="00:13:06.063" style="s2">DAMIAN! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.399" end="00:13:11.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE HEARD ME.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.199" end="00:13:13.599" style="s2">HE JUST chose not to turn around. The</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.499" end="00:13:15.699" style="s2">boy who held me 10 years ago and swore</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.599" end="00:13:18.899" style="s2">he&#39;d protect me</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.699" end="00:13:18.899" style="s2">died a long time ago.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.199" end="00:13:27.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the Lord&#39;s name,</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.899" end="00:13:27.699" style="s2">let me end your immortal sin.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.099" end="00:13:41.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not your time to die yet, Selene</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.699" end="00:13:41.099" style="s2">Morelli.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.399" end="00:13:51.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those little bastards. I&#39;ll kill them.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.499" end="00:13:53.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; August, don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.499" end="00:13:56.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Selene,</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.099" end="00:13:58.499" style="s2">you saved my life and theirs.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.199" end="00:14:00.599" style="s2">And this is how they repair you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.499" end="00:14:02.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t blame yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.599" end="00:14:04.099" style="s2">They&#39;ll get what they deserve. Just</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.999" end="00:14:06.199" style="s2">not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.099" end="00:14:08.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She definitely tattled. Let&#39;s go in,</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.199" end="00:14:11.799" style="s2">fake an apology, get it over with.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.899" end="00:14:13.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, look who&#39;s awake. Saint Selene. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.799" end="00:14:14.699" style="s2">told you you&#39;d be hard to kill.</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.399" end="00:14:16.301" style="s2">We didn&#39;t have a choice back there.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.699" end="00:14:18.101" style="s2">Morgana&#39;s only a half breed. She can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.301" end="00:14:19.401" style="s2">heal like you can. If we hadn&#39;t left you</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.101" end="00:14:20.701" style="s2">to hold off the hunters, she would have</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.401" end="00:14:22.401" style="s2">died.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.701" end="00:14:24.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shoved the woman who saved your lives</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.401" end="00:14:25.001" style="s2">into a hail of bullets and ran off with</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.101" end="00:14:26.501" style="s2">that [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.001" end="00:14:28.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, we&#39;re here to apologize, aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.501" end="00:14:30.001" style="s2">we?</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.001" end="00:14:32.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologize?</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.001" end="00:14:34.701" style="s2">I should kill all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.201" end="00:14:34.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.501" end="00:14:41.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My hand.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.901" end="00:14:49.701" style="s2">It was you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.601" end="00:14:49.701" style="s2">You put an illusion on us.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.101" end="00:14:52.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.501" end="00:14:54.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.801" end="00:14:56.201" style="s2">The curse was broken years ago and we</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.401" end="00:14:58.501" style="s2">just grew claws. Who else could be</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.201" end="00:15:00.601" style="s2">behind it? Celine, you think you can</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.501" end="00:15:02.101" style="s2">scare us into marrying you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.601" end="00:15:04.401" style="s2">Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.101" end="00:15:06.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celine must still be angry.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.401" end="00:15:08.401" style="s2">She&#39;s hurt so badly. Of course she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.201" end="00:15:09.501" style="s2">upset. Don&#39;t blame her. She only acts</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.401" end="00:15:09.801" style="s2">like this because she loves you too</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.501" end="00:15:11.401" style="s2">much.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.801" end="00:15:12.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop defending her.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.401" end="00:15:13.801" style="s2">Princess, the family council is coming</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.701" end="00:15:16.301" style="s2">up and you don&#39;t even have a decent</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.801" end="00:15:19.001" style="s2">dress. Come on. I&#39;ll take you shopping.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.301" end="00:15:19.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m coming too.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.201" end="00:15:28.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I almost forgot.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.101" end="00:15:31.101" style="s2">I don&#39;t even have a proper dress for the</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.501" end="00:15:31.101" style="s2">banquet.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.101" end="00:15:35.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, what a coincidence.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.901" end="00:15:39.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blind girl, can you even tell what color</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.301" end="00:15:40.901" style="s2">that dress is?</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.601" end="00:15:43.601" style="s2">Honestly, you could walk around naked</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.901" end="00:15:46.101" style="s2">and no one would care.</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.601" end="00:15:46.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.401" end="00:15:49.701" style="s2">Tomorrow you&#39;d better choose anyone but</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.301" end="00:15:50.801" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.701" end="00:15:53.601" style="s2">Otherwise you&#39;re going to make your own</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.801" end="00:15:53.601" style="s2">life miserable.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.101" end="00:15:57.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine, you&#39;re blind.</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.701" end="00:15:59.501" style="s2">What exactly do you think you can</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.701" end="00:16:01.501" style="s2">compete with me for?</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.501" end="00:16:02.601" style="s2">All I have to do is cry</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.501" end="00:16:04.701" style="s2">and they&#39;ll throw you out of here for</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.601" end="00:16:06.501" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.701" end="00:16:08.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana, I have no interest in fighting</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.501" end="00:16:09.601" style="s2">you over five beasts.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.301" end="00:16:12.601" style="s2">Just don&#39;t do anything that puts this</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.601" end="00:16:12.601" style="s2">family in danger.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.901" end="00:16:19.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celine, please stop me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.202" end="00:16:24.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re [ __ ] hopeless.</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.402" end="00:16:31.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here we go again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.302" end="00:16:31.102" style="s2">I should have given up hope long ago.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.402" end="00:16:37.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine,</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.502" end="00:16:37.302" style="s2">you&#39;re finally awake.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.602" end="00:16:40.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.196" end="00:16:42.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.502" end="00:16:43.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We came to apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.202" end="00:16:45.202" style="s2">We lost our tempers yesterday. We</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.602" end="00:16:46.702" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t have hit you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.202" end="00:16:49.302" style="s2">You gave up your eyes to save us, and we</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.702" end="00:16:51.002" style="s2">treated you like that. We were [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.302" end="00:16:52.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine,</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.002" end="00:16:54.606" style="s2">can you forgive us?</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.702" end="00:16:54.802" style="s2">We swear we&#39;ll never do it again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.606" end="00:16:56.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.802" end="00:16:57.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His hand is still decided never to trust</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.702" end="00:16:59.802" style="s2">them again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.902" end="00:17:02.002" style="s2">So why does one apology make me remember</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.802" end="00:17:03.102" style="s2">the way things used to be?</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.002" end="00:17:05.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your favorite.</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.102" end="00:17:07.102" style="s2">I went out and bought them just for you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.102" end="00:17:08.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need any of this.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.102" end="00:17:09.702" style="s2">I just need you to believe me once.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.702" end="00:17:12.702" style="s2">Morgana really is</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.702" end="00:17:12.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana is dying.</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.902" end="00:17:20.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.402" end="00:17:21.802" style="s2">They didn&#39;t stay for me. They were</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.102" end="00:17:23.302" style="s2">guarding a blood bag they could drain</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.802" end="00:17:26.302" style="s2">for Morgana.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.302" end="00:17:29.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s had a high fever since yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.302" end="00:17:31.502" style="s2">The doctor says her vitals are crashing.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.502" end="00:17:33.502" style="s2">You cut her in the storage room, then</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.502" end="00:17:36.102" style="s2">pushed her again.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.502" end="00:17:37.202" style="s2">She&#39;s always been fragile.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.102" end="00:17:39.802" style="s2">This time,</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.202" end="00:17:41.602" style="s2">she really may not make it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.802" end="00:17:43.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s absurd.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.602" end="00:17:45.302" style="s2">I never hurt her.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.602" end="00:17:46.902" style="s2">And you seriously believe a vampire gets</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.302" end="00:17:48.102" style="s2">a fever and ends up dying because she</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.902" end="00:17:50.002" style="s2">got shoved?</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.102" end="00:17:52.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.002" end="00:17:52.702" style="s2">Morgana isn&#39;t some blessed saint like</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.002" end="00:17:54.602" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.702" end="00:17:55.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever caused this,</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.602" end="00:17:57.302" style="s2">you&#39;re the only one who can save her</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.802" end="00:17:58.802" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.302" end="00:18:00.002" style="s2">Your blood heals wounds and cures</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.802" end="00:18:01.502" style="s2">illness.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.002" end="00:18:03.202" style="s2">You saved father.</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.502" end="00:18:04.602" style="s2">You saved us.</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.202" end="00:18:05.302" style="s2">Save her too.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.602" end="00:18:07.702" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.302" end="00:18:09.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t do this.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.702" end="00:18:09.802" style="s2">I shouldn&#39;t have to pay for one of her</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.202" end="00:18:11.602" style="s2">tricks.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.802" end="00:18:14.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop the axe, Celine.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.602" end="00:18:16.902" style="s2">You&#39;re blind. You&#39;re dead weight.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.802" end="00:18:18.802" style="s2">If your blood can save Morgana, then</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.902" end="00:18:22.103" style="s2">that&#39;s the most useful thing a worthless</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.802" end="00:18:22.103" style="s2">girl like you will ever do.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.303" end="00:18:28.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.803" end="00:18:29.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saving Morgana.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.503" end="00:18:30.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop fighting, Celine. You&#39;re only</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.903" end="00:18:32.503" style="s2">MAKING THIS WORSE.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.703" end="00:18:34.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; JUST HOLD STILL. It could be over soon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.503" end="00:18:35.703" style="s2">Haven&#39;t you always wanted to help us?</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.303" end="00:18:37.503" style="s2">This is your chance.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.703" end="00:18:39.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saved them.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.503" end="00:18:41.803" style="s2">I thought that at the very least when I</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.803" end="00:18:44.303" style="s2">was close to dying, they&#39;d remember</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.803" end="00:18:44.303" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.303" end="00:18:48.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cece,</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.903" end="00:18:50.303" style="s2">tell me who did this to you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.803" end="00:18:52.403" style="s2">Was it those animals?</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.303" end="00:18:53.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; August, I&#39;m fine. You know how fast I</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.403" end="00:18:55.783" style="s2">heal. I&#39;ll be back on my feet in a</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.903" end="00:18:57.803" style="s2">couple of days.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.783" end="00:18:57.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.603" end="00:19:02.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This came from the Nott family. Lucien</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.903" end="00:19:04.503" style="s2">Nott insists that the moment the family</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.703" end="00:19:05.703" style="s2">council ends, preparations for your</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.503" end="00:19:07.103" style="s2">wedding begin.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.703" end="00:19:09.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.103" end="00:19:09.803" style="s2">I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.703" end="00:19:14.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard Miss Celine is announcing her</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.403" end="00:19:15.503" style="s2">fiance today.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.003" end="00:19:18.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wonder which of those five lucky</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.503" end="00:19:18.703" style="s2">idiots gets the beauty.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.303" end="00:19:29.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elders, I have an announcement. Celine</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.603" end="00:19:31.903" style="s2">Moretti, the saint of our clan whom I</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.803" end="00:19:34.203" style="s2">love as my own daughter, will name the</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.903" end="00:19:35.903" style="s2">man she has chosen as her husband.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.203" end="00:19:38.103" style="s2">Whoever she chooses will receive the</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.903" end="00:19:41.103" style="s2">position of Sanjini patriarch and the</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.103" end="00:19:41.103" style="s2">full inheritance.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.403" end="00:19:46.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course she&#39;s going to choose me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.303" end="00:19:51.503" style="s2">After all this drama, she&#39;s still going</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.303" end="00:19:52.703" style="s2">to pick Damian. She gave up her eyes for</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.503" end="00:19:54.503" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.703" end="00:19:58.203" style="s2">You really think she can let go?</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.503" end="00:19:58.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man I choose to marry is</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.003" end="00:20:04.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celine, [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.103" end="00:20:06.203" style="s2">please don&#39;t throw me out. Miss Celine,</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.603" end="00:20:07.903" style="s2">I know I&#39;m lowborn. I&#39;m just a</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.203" end="00:20:10.103" style="s2">half-breed bastard. I&#39;m not worthy of</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.903" end="00:20:12.103" style="s2">the Sanjini brothers. Please just don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.103" end="00:20:13.803" style="s2">send me away. Let me stay by their side</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.103" end="00:20:16.903" style="s2">as a maid. I&#39;ll serve them, pour their</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.803" end="00:20:18.503" style="s2">tea, do anything. That&#39;s all I want.</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.903" end="00:20:19.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana, get up.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.503" end="00:20:22.103" style="s2">Who told you to degrade yourself like</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.803" end="00:20:22.103" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.203" end="00:20:26.005" style="s2">Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.403" end="00:20:29.105" style="s2">You&#39;re princess.</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.005" end="00:20:29.105" style="s2">You&#39;re good enough for anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.105" end="00:20:33.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine,</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.105" end="00:20:36.105" style="s2">what the hell did you do to her? Look</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.005" end="00:20:36.105" style="s2">how terrified she is.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.705" end="00:20:40.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Filthy half-breed [ __ ] Who let you</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.805" end="00:20:42.305" style="s2">into a family council? Who the hell do</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.905" end="00:20:43.405" style="s2">you think you are barging in here and</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.305" end="00:20:44.705" style="s2">making a scene?</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.405" end="00:20:46.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.705" end="00:20:47.705" style="s2">Put the gun down. She&#39;s the love of my</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.705" end="00:20:49.005" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.705" end="00:20:50.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.005" end="00:20:51.705" style="s2">if you&#39;re going to shoot,</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.505" end="00:20:53.005" style="s2">you&#39;ll have to shoot all five of us</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.705" end="00:20:55.405" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.005" end="00:20:57.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t compete with a saint.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.405" end="00:20:59.105" style="s2">I have no name, no status, no one who</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.605" end="00:21:01.205" style="s2">cares about me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.105" end="00:21:04.405" style="s2">The only thing I can do is die to prove</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.205" end="00:21:04.405" style="s2">how much I love them.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.705" end="00:21:14.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all your fault. You drove her to</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.605" end="00:21:15.805" style="s2">this. You knew how fragile she was and</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.405" end="00:21:17.905" style="s2">you still humiliated her in front of the</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.805" end="00:21:20.205" style="s2">whole council. Are you happy now? She</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.905" end="00:21:21.205" style="s2">killed Morgana. Celine, you&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.205" end="00:21:22.905" style="s2">pay for this.</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.205" end="00:21:25.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They care this much about Morgana and</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.905" end="00:21:27.505" style="s2">treat the saint like that?</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.105" end="00:21:29.405" style="s2">You five worthless bastards.</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.505" end="00:21:31.105" style="s2">One half-breed whip has you so blinded</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.405" end="00:21:32.005" style="s2">you can&#39;t even see Celine&#39;s goodness</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.105" end="00:21:33.005" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.005" end="00:21:34.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good?</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.005" end="00:21:37.505" style="s2">She uses that old favor to hold our</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.805" end="00:21:39.805" style="s2">entire family hostage. Let me make this</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.505" end="00:21:42.705" style="s2">clear. We will never marry a blind,</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.805" end="00:21:44.705" style="s2">vicious, useless burden like her.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.705" end="00:21:46.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; According to an ancient rite, a saint&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.705" end="00:21:47.605" style="s2">heart can pull someone back from the</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.105" end="00:21:49.005" style="s2">edge of death.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.605" end="00:21:50.905" style="s2">If we take Celine&#39;s heart before the</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.005" end="00:21:54.105" style="s2">lunar eclipse is complete,</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.905" end="00:21:54.105" style="s2">Morgana can still be saved.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.005" end="00:21:58.105" style="s2">Celine, you&#39;re a saint.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.605" end="00:21:59.405" style="s2">You can&#39;t die.</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.105" end="00:22:02.305" style="s2">What&#39;s the big deal about making one</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.405" end="00:22:02.305" style="s2">little sacrifice?</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.605" end="00:22:06.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You killed Morgana.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.705" end="00:22:08.905" style="s2">YOU OWE HER YOUR LIFE.</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.605" end="00:22:10.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BUT now I finally understand.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.905" end="00:22:12.405" style="s2">Covering for them only gives them</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.305" end="00:22:15.405" style="s2">permission to hurt me more.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.405" end="00:22:16.705" style="s2">You traded my eyes for your human forms.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.405" end="00:22:20.305" style="s2">Now it&#39;s time to see the price of</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.705" end="00:22:20.305" style="s2">betraying me with your own eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.805" end="00:22:26.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Traitor.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.205" end="00:22:30.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What that?</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.806" end="00:22:33.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You again.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.206" end="00:22:35.306" style="s2">You&#39;re using illusions to remind us that</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.906" end="00:22:36.806" style="s2">you saved us.</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.306" end="00:22:38.506" style="s2">How many times are you GOING TO RUB IT</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.806" end="00:22:39.806" style="s2">IN OUR FACES?</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.506" end="00:22:41.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CELINE,</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.806" end="00:22:42.906" style="s2">we&#39;ve spoiled you for years. Isn&#39;t that</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.806" end="00:22:44.206" style="s2">enough?</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.906" end="00:22:46.006" style="s2">You still think you can chain us to you</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.206" end="00:22:47.906" style="s2">forever with those eyes?</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.006" end="00:22:48.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.906" end="00:22:50.306" style="s2">Let&#39;s make this clear in front of</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.906" end="00:22:52.306" style="s2">everyone today.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.306" end="00:22:54.506" style="s2">No matter what you do, none of us will</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.306" end="00:22:57.106" style="s2">ever marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.506" end="00:23:00.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You animals. How dare you lay a hand on</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.106" end="00:23:01.306" style="s2">Celine? Have you forgotten your oath?</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.106" end="00:23:02.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.306" end="00:23:04.706" style="s2">who else is ever going to look at her</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.606" end="00:23:06.506" style="s2">twice besides the five of us? There</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.706" end="00:23:08.706" style="s2">isn&#39;t a second man in this world who&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.506" end="00:23:09.906" style="s2">want a scheming woman who even uses her</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.706" end="00:23:11.706" style="s2">blindness.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.906" end="00:23:13.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So in their eyes,</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.706" end="00:23:16.306" style="s2">even my blindness is fake. And I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.906" end="00:23:17.131" style="s2">choose any of you five. My future</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.306" end="00:23:19.006" style="s2">husband is</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.131" end="00:23:20.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.006" end="00:23:22.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana&#39;s [snorts] alive. She&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.806" end="00:23:24.806" style="s2">dead.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.306" end="00:23:27.706" style="s2">Morgana can still be saved. Hurry. Get</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.806" end="00:23:27.706" style="s2">her to the infirmary.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.106" end="00:23:31.306" style="s2">Whoever you&#39;re using to make us jealous,</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.606" end="00:23:34.706" style="s2">it won&#39;t work.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.306" end="00:23:34.706" style="s2">Celine, we&#39;re not falling for this.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.506" end="00:23:52.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the Knot Blood Crystal ring.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.506" end="00:23:56.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I, Celine Morelli,</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.806" end="00:23:57.806" style="s2">choose Lucian Knot as my husband.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.006" end="00:23:59.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dear fiancee,</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.806" end="00:24:01.006" style="s2">are you calling for me?</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.406" end="00:24:03.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CC,</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.006" end="00:24:05.206" style="s2">I failed you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.106" end="00:24:08.906" style="s2">I raised five sons and somehow didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.206" end="00:24:08.906" style="s2">manage to raise one decent man.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.306" end="00:24:12.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; August, I&#39;m the one who owes you an</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.906" end="00:24:15.106" style="s2">apology.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.706" end="00:24:16.306" style="s2">There&#39;s something I never told you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.106" end="00:24:18.506" style="s2">Back then,</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.306" end="00:24:20.706" style="s2">to break the curse on all five of them,</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.506" end="00:24:22.506" style="s2">I traded my eyes to a demon. But if they</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.706" end="00:24:24.706" style="s2">ever betrayed me,</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.506" end="00:24:26.206" style="s2">the curse would rebound.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.706" end="00:24:27.908" style="s2">On the night of the lunar eclipse,</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.206" end="00:24:31.307" style="s2">they&#39;d lose their minds completely and</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.908" end="00:24:33.107" style="s2">become true bat monsters.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.307" end="00:24:34.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.107" end="00:24:36.908" style="s2">what happened to them just now means the</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.607" end="00:24:39.908" style="s2">curse is already started?</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.908" end="00:24:39.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, August.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.607" end="00:24:45.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They brought this on themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.507" end="00:24:48.107" style="s2">From now on, you are my [music] only</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.107" end="00:24:51.207" style="s2">child. I, August Sanguini, recognize</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.107" end="00:24:51.207" style="s2">only you as my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.607" end="00:24:54.707" style="s2">I have a wedding gift for you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.007" end="00:25:01.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;s Morgana?</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.607" end="00:25:03.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s out of danger.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.408" end="00:25:04.507" style="s2">But Silver wounded her, so she&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.007" end="00:25:05.862" style="s2">weak for a while.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.507" end="00:25:07.882" style="s2">She needs rest.</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.862" end="00:25:07.882" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.207" end="00:25:12.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank God.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.507" end="00:25:13.807" style="s2">Thank God she&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.307" end="00:25:14.908" style="s2">If she died, I never would have forgiven</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.807" end="00:25:16.507" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.908" end="00:25:18.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.507" end="00:25:19.707" style="s2">It&#39;s Selena&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.207" end="00:25:22.507" style="s2">If she hadn&#39;t pushed Morgana that far,</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.707" end="00:25:24.007" style="s2">none of this would have happened.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.507" end="00:25:26.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana loves us more than anyone in the</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.007" end="00:25:28.408" style="s2">world. She was willing to die for us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.607" end="00:25:29.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speaking of which,</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.408" end="00:25:31.408" style="s2">why hasn&#39;t Selena come begging us to</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.908" end="00:25:33.408" style="s2">forgive her yet? She almost drove</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.408" end="00:25:35.607" style="s2">Morgana to death. She&#39;s likely hiding</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.408" end="00:25:37.107" style="s2">with Father, crying and waiting for us</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.607" end="00:25:38.807" style="s2">to go comfort her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.107" end="00:25:41.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s always the same.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.807" end="00:25:43.207" style="s2">She causes trouble, runs crying to</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.007" end="00:25:44.807" style="s2">Father, and then we&#39;re THE ONES FORCED</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.207" end="00:25:46.207" style="s2">TO APOLOGIZE.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.807" end="00:25:47.607" style="s2">WHY SHOULD WE?</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.207" end="00:25:49.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you think Selena&#39;s been acting</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.607" end="00:25:50.607" style="s2">strange lately?</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.107" end="00:25:51.807" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t cling to us like she used</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.607" end="00:25:53.607" style="s2">to.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.807" end="00:25:55.607" style="s2">And at the family council,</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.607" end="00:25:57.607" style="s2">she said the demon gave her eyes back.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.607" end="00:25:59.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That just proves she&#39;s still milking the</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.607" end="00:26:01.507" style="s2">past.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.207" end="00:26:03.107" style="s2">It&#39;s all one of her illusions.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.507" end="00:26:05.507" style="s2">She&#39;s always been good at making us feel</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.107" end="00:26:07.107" style="s2">guilty. Don&#39;t fall for it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.507" end="00:26:09.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But whenever she was hurt before, she&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.107" end="00:26:11.707" style="s2">come to us right away.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.707" end="00:26:14.207" style="s2">This time she hasn&#39;t come once, what we</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.707" end="00:26:17.507" style="s2">said in front of the elders.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.207" end="00:26:17.507" style="s2">Do you think maybe we went too far?</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.007" end="00:26:28.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE IT IS AGAIN. SELENA&#39;S USING CHEAP</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.408" end="00:26:30.207" style="s2">TRICKS TO scare us AND FORCE US BACK TO</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.507" end="00:26:31.809" style="s2">HER SIDE.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.207" end="00:26:33.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She thinks this will scare us?</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.809" end="00:26:35.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s wrong. The more she pulls this</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.609" end="00:26:37.809" style="s2">crap, the more disgusted I am.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.509" end="00:26:40.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We really should teach her a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.809" end="00:26:43.209" style="s2">We&#39;ve spoiled her for years. She needs</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.009" end="00:26:43.209" style="s2">to learn the hard way.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.509" end="00:26:46.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My head,</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.909" end="00:26:50.809" style="s2">it hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.809" end="00:26:50.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop the act. It&#39;s just me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.709" end="00:26:56.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really are something. Those idiots</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.709" end="00:26:58.009" style="s2">are wrapped around your finger.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.209" end="00:27:00.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never forced them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.009" end="00:27:01.609" style="s2">I only gave them an excuse.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.309" end="00:27:03.109" style="s2">They&#39;re the ones who decided everything</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.609" end="00:27:06.109" style="s2">Celine ever did for them was something</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.109" end="00:27:06.109" style="s2">they were entitled to.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.809" end="00:27:13.909" style="s2">Those five horny idiots will hand me the</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.409" end="00:27:14.509" style="s2">Sanguani crown the second I pretend I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.909" end="00:27:15.909" style="s2">dying.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.509" end="00:27:17.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.909" end="00:27:19.909" style="s2">The five of them may be idiots, but old</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.709" end="00:27:22.109" style="s2">Sanguani isn&#39;t easy to fool.</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.909" end="00:27:23.409" style="s2">And don&#39;t push Celine too far either.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.109" end="00:27:25.709" style="s2">I heard she&#39;s about to marry Lucian</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.409" end="00:27:25.709" style="s2">Knott.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.909" end="00:27:28.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucian Knott?</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.409" end="00:27:37.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who did you just say Celine is marrying?</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.409" end="00:27:44.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian,</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.709" end="00:27:44.609" style="s2">what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.809" end="00:27:49.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.609" end="00:27:50.709" style="s2">I was only saying.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.209" end="00:27:52.889" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t let them find out Celine is</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.709" end="00:27:54.909" style="s2">marrying Lucian Knott.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.889" end="00:27:54.909" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.509" end="00:27:59.709" style="s2">Damian, darling, the doctor was only</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.809" end="00:28:03.709" style="s2">telling me about my condition. Please</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.709" end="00:28:03.709" style="s2">let him go. You&#39;re scaring me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.989" end="00:28:09.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.909" end="00:28:11.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LUCIAN KNOTT HASN&#39;T APPEARED IN PUBLIC</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.609" end="00:28:13.009" style="s2">FOR CENTURIES. There&#39;s no way he&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.209" end="00:28:15.009" style="s2">really want her. Even if the Knott</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.009" end="00:28:16.909" style="s2">family sent a ring, that doesn&#39;t mean</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.009" end="00:28:18.409" style="s2">Lucian himself will show up. Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.909" end="00:28:19.309" style="s2">Celine and father staged the whole</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.409" end="00:28:21.509" style="s2">thing.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.309" end="00:28:23.309" style="s2">Once her life falls apart.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.509" end="00:28:24.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.309" end="00:28:25.909" style="s2">She thinks this will force us to marry</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.909" end="00:28:28.709" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.909" end="00:28:28.709" style="s2">How naive.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.609" end="00:28:33.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They keep saying they don&#39;t care about</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.109" end="00:28:36.110" style="s2">Celine, but they sure don&#39;t look like</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.110" end="00:28:36.110" style="s2">men who don&#39;t care.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.510" end="00:28:40.110" style="s2">Damian,</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.410" end="00:28:41.310" style="s2">the doctor said I may not have much time</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.110" end="00:28:42.610" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.310" end="00:28:44.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.610" end="00:28:47.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only a lowly half breed. My body</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.910" end="00:28:48.910" style="s2">can&#39;t handle wounds from silver.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.110" end="00:28:51.510" style="s2">The injury isn&#39;t healing. It&#39;s getting</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.910" end="00:28:53.810" style="s2">worse. The doctor says</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.510" end="00:28:55.810" style="s2">I may only have a little time left.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.810" end="00:28:58.310" style="s2">I&#39;m not afraid to die.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.810" end="00:28:59.910" style="s2">I just can&#39;t bear to leave all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.310" end="00:29:01.710" style="s2">Before I go,</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.910" end="00:29:04.210" style="s2">will you stay with me?</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.710" end="00:29:05.410" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to die alone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.210" end="00:29:07.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.410" end="00:29:09.910" style="s2">You&#39;re not going to die.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.110" end="00:29:09.910" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.310" end="00:29:13.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.710" end="00:29:15.310" style="s2">If I can spend my last days with you,</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.210" end="00:29:17.010" style="s2">that&#39;s already more than enough.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.310" end="00:29:18.110" style="s2">I only have one wish.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.010" end="00:29:19.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell us.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.110" end="00:29:20.710" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.310" end="00:29:21.310" style="s2">We&#39;d pull the stars out of the sky for</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.710" end="00:29:22.310" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.310" end="00:29:24.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could we</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.310" end="00:29:26.010" style="s2">have a secret wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.110" end="00:29:28.110" style="s2">I don&#39;t need the family&#39;s approval. I</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.010" end="00:29:29.810" style="s2">don&#39;t need the inheritance. If the five</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.110" end="00:29:32.010" style="s2">of you put your blood into the same cup</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.810" end="00:29:33.810" style="s2">according to the old vampire rite, then</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.010" end="00:29:37.510" style="s2">we&#39;ll belong to each other forever.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.810" end="00:29:38.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why wouldn&#39;t we? I&#39;d love nothing more.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.510" end="00:29:40.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.910" end="00:29:42.210" style="s2">Morgana,</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.710" end="00:29:44.410" style="s2">we&#39;ll give you a wedding that belongs to</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.210" end="00:29:46.110" style="s2">just the six of us. The Sanguini family</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.410" end="00:29:48.910" style="s2">has a crown that&#39;s been passed down</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.110" end="00:29:50.610" style="s2">since the Victorian era.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.910" end="00:29:52.210" style="s2">I&#39;ll get it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.610" end="00:29:54.110" style="s2">Nothing else is worthy of you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.210" end="00:29:56.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could I accept that?</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.110" end="00:29:56.710" style="s2">It&#39;s a Sanguini heirloom. I&#39;m only a</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.010" end="00:29:59.310" style="s2">half breed maid.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.710" end="00:30:01.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You deserve it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.310" end="00:30:05.710" style="s2">Forget one crown.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.510" end="00:30:05.710" style="s2">I&#39;d give you the entire Sanguini family.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.710" end="00:30:10.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; August gave me this family heirloom as a</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.510" end="00:30:11.810" style="s2">wedding gift.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.010" end="00:30:14.910" style="s2">He wants the Not family to know I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.810" end="00:30:16.810" style="s2">some poor orphan with no one behind me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.910" end="00:30:19.910" style="s2">As long as I have him,</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.810" end="00:30:19.910" style="s2">I have nothing to fear.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.010" end="00:30:26.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You even prepared a wedding dress.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.610" end="00:30:28.710" style="s2">Who exactly are you planning to marry?</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.510" end="00:30:30.410" style="s2">Please stop dreaming, Celine.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.710" end="00:30:31.610" style="s2">The five of us swore we&#39;d never marry</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.410" end="00:30:33.410" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.610" end="00:30:35.510" style="s2">Whatever trick you&#39;re trying, it won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.410" end="00:30:38.212" style="s2">work. You think having a wedding dress</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.510" end="00:30:40.712" style="s2">means someone will actually marry you?</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.212" end="00:30:42.312" style="s2">Celine, we&#39;re not children anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.712" end="00:30:44.212" style="s2">No one&#39;s playing house with you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.312" end="00:30:48.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it a rest.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.212" end="00:30:48.112" style="s2">Who are you even wearing that dress for?</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.086" end="00:30:52.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.412" end="00:30:53.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This belongs to the Sanguini family. How</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.212" end="00:30:55.312" style="s2">dare you steal it?</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.312" end="00:30:56.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t steal it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.312" end="00:30:59.012" style="s2">August gave it to me himself as a</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.812" end="00:31:00.412" style="s2">wedding gift.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.012" end="00:31:03.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.412" end="00:31:03.312" style="s2">Morgana needs it more.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.912" end="00:31:07.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have no right to take that.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.112" end="00:31:12.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would be the point?</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.112" end="00:31:14.812" style="s2">We&#39;re never going to marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.912" end="00:31:18.612" style="s2">A crown like this on your head would</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.812" end="00:31:18.612" style="s2">only make you look ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.412" end="00:31:24.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, father&#39;s not here. Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.512" end="00:31:25.412" style="s2">If a saint&#39;s heart can save someone, why</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.312" end="00:31:27.212" style="s2">don&#39;t we take it now?</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.412" end="00:31:29.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grayson,</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.212" end="00:31:31.712" style="s2">you can&#39;t do this to me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.812" end="00:31:33.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine, stop pretending.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.712" end="00:31:35.312" style="s2">We&#39;re immortal vampires. Unless it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.612" end="00:31:37.212" style="s2">sunlight or silver, nothing truly kills</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.312" end="00:31:38.712" style="s2">us. We&#39;re only taking your heart to save</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.212" end="00:31:40.012" style="s2">Morgana. It&#39;ll grow back. It&#39;s worth</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.712" end="00:31:41.312" style="s2">trying.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.012" end="00:31:42.712" style="s2">Your blood heals wounds, so your heart</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.312" end="00:31:44.412" style="s2">should be even stronger.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.712" end="00:31:46.312" style="s2">Maybe then Morgana won&#39;t have to die.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.412" end="00:31:47.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you even hear yourselves?</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.312" end="00:31:49.212" style="s2">You&#39;re going to rip the heart out of the</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.412" end="00:31:51.412" style="s2">sister who grew up with you</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.212" end="00:31:53.312" style="s2">for a half-breed maid?</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.412" end="00:31:56.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not like we want to,</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.312" end="00:31:59.012" style="s2">but Morgana is dying. You&#39;re a saint.</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.012" end="00:31:59.012" style="s2">YOU CAN&#39;T DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.612" end="00:32:06.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CELINE, THIS IS YOUR LAST CHANCE.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.012" end="00:32:08.112" style="s2">IF YOU HAVE ANY conscience left, cut</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.312" end="00:32:08.712" style="s2">your own chest open. Don&#39;t make us do</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.112" end="00:32:10.912" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.712" end="00:32:12.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian,</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.912" end="00:32:15.612" style="s2">you once promised you&#39;d protect me for</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.712" end="00:32:17.512" style="s2">the rest of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.612" end="00:32:19.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have time. Morgana could die</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.512" end="00:32:21.212" style="s2">any second. Use this iron blade. We only</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.712" end="00:32:23.912" style="s2">need your heart. We&#39;re not actually</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.212" end="00:32:23.912" style="s2">trying to kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.012" end="00:32:27.712" style="s2">If you can&#39;t do it,</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.712" end="00:32:29.512" style="s2">I will.</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.712" end="00:32:31.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, please.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.512" end="00:32:33.612" style="s2">Don&#39;t do this to me. We grew up</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.712" end="00:32:35.852" style="s2">together. You said I was your most</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.612" end="00:32:37.872" style="s2">precious little sister.</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.852" end="00:32:37.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.813" end="00:32:49.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m finally done waiting for all of you</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.513" end="00:32:52.213" style="s2">to turn back.</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.013" end="00:32:56.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My bride is bleeding. I will not spare</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.213" end="00:32:56.313" style="s2">anyone who hurts her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.113" end="00:33:00.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine,</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.313" end="00:33:02.413" style="s2">you hurt me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.813" end="00:33:05.813" style="s2">I was only trying to save Morgana and</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.413" end="00:33:05.813" style="s2">you actually tried to kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.413" end="00:33:08.713" style="s2">Forget it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.713" end="00:33:12.313" style="s2">We need to get the crown back to</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.713" end="00:33:12.313" style="s2">Morgana. She doesn&#39;t have much time.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.913" end="00:33:16.913" style="s2">Let&#39;s go. Celine&#39;s a pure blood. Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.513" end="00:33:17.913" style="s2">her heart would be too much for Morgana</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.913" end="00:33:19.213" style="s2">anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.913" end="00:33:20.913" style="s2">Morgana&#39;s too fragile to handle that</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.213" end="00:33:22.013" style="s2">kind of power.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.913" end="00:33:24.813" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.013" end="00:33:26.313" style="s2">We save Morgana first.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.813" end="00:33:28.713" style="s2">Try hurting someone again and I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.313" end="00:33:30.413" style="s2">let you off.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.713" end="00:33:32.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The five brothers I grew up with tried</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.413" end="00:33:34.613" style="s2">to cut out my heart and the fiance I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.913" end="00:33:37.713" style="s2">never even met</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.613" end="00:33:37.713" style="s2">was the one who saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.913" end="00:33:45.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cece,</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.113" end="00:33:48.513" style="s2">who did this? Who dares cause trouble on</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.513" end="00:33:48.513" style="s2">Sanguini land?</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.913" end="00:33:58.813" style="s2">It was those five bastards, wasn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.313" end="00:34:01.213" style="s2">I&#39;m going to kill them.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.813" end="00:34:02.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; August, please calm down.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.213" end="00:34:04.813" style="s2">Vampires who kill their own blood are</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.813" end="00:34:07.313" style="s2">cursed for eternity.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.813" end="00:34:07.313" style="s2">The five of</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.313" end="00:34:17.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.113" end="00:34:18.713" style="s2">I won&#39;t kill them.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.113" end="00:34:21.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a shame they stole the wedding</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.713" end="00:34:21.613" style="s2">gift you gave me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.813" end="00:34:25.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They took the crown to that half breed,</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.513" end="00:34:27.313" style="s2">didn&#39;t they?</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.213" end="00:34:29.413" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Cece.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.313" end="00:34:32.813" style="s2">Any non pure blood who wears that crown</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.413" end="00:34:32.813" style="s2">will suffer its backlash.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.813" end="00:34:38.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; August, the crown is set with the</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.613" end="00:34:40.813" style="s2">Sanguini blood crystal. If Morgana takes</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.913" end="00:34:41.514" style="s2">it, could that affect you?</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.813" end="00:34:43.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cece, don&#39;t tell</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.514" end="00:34:44.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me those ancient fairy tales fooled you</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.314" end="00:34:45.614" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.114" end="00:34:47.314" style="s2">You think owning one pretty stone can</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.614" end="00:34:49.114" style="s2">overthrow an entire family? That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.314" end="00:34:50.314" style="s2">ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.114" end="00:34:51.614" style="s2">Cece,</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.314" end="00:34:53.414" style="s2">stop wasting your heart on those</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.614" end="00:34:56.014" style="s2">bastards. In three days you&#39;ll be the</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.414" end="00:34:57.414" style="s2">lady of the Knott family. Remember this.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.014" end="00:34:58.914" style="s2">If Lucian Knott shows you even the</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.414" end="00:35:01.514" style="s2">slightest disrespect, you tell me</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.914" end="00:35:01.514" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.514" end="00:35:08.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, what is that?</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.214" end="00:35:08.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re under attack. RUDIS, GET THE GUNS.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.514" end="00:35:12.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EVERYBODY STAND DOWN. No one fires.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.329" end="00:35:18.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.814" end="00:35:28.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sanjini, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.514" end="00:35:28.014" style="s2">Miss Celine.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.914" end="00:35:33.114" style="s2">I am the butler of the Knott family.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.739" end="00:35:36.114" style="s2">[music] My master, Lucian Knott,</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.114" end="00:35:38.614" style="s2">ordered me to deliver a gift.</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.114" end="00:35:38.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.219" end="00:35:43.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.114" end="00:35:46.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My master wishes to marry you at Knott</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.514" end="00:35:47.814" style="s2">Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.614" end="00:35:49.314" style="s2">He will be waiting at Black Harbor</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.814" end="00:35:51.814" style="s2">Estate. [music] Please arrive before</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.314" end="00:35:51.814" style="s2">sunrise.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.414" end="00:35:55.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I accept.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.814" end="00:35:56.114" style="s2">Tell Lucian I&#39;ll be there on time.</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.629" end="00:35:58.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.114" end="00:36:01.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will deliver your words exactly. Then</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.114" end="00:36:01.414" style="s2">I shall take my leave, Miss Celine.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.144" end="00:36:06.164" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.114" end="00:36:15.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgana,</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.214" end="00:36:15.014" style="s2">look what we brought you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.314" end="00:36:20.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.714" end="00:36:21.514" style="s2">for me?</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.114" end="00:36:24.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.514" end="00:36:24.714" style="s2">You&#39;re the only one worthy of it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.514" end="00:36:35.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.814" end="00:36:38.114" style="s2">TAKE IT OFF. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.114" end="00:36:38.114" style="s2">GET IT OFF ME.</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.114" end="00:36:44.155" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MORGANA.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.135" end="00:36:44.155" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.214" end="00:36:46.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT HURTS.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.416" end="00:36:48.016" style="s2">MY FACE.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.716" end="00:36:50.516" style="s2">IS my face ruined?</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.016" end="00:36:52.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine, she did this. She must have</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.516" end="00:36:53.516" style="s2">tampered with the crown. That vicious</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.216" end="00:36:55.416" style="s2">woman knew we were giving the crown to</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.516" end="00:36:58.416" style="s2">Morgana, so she cursed it on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.416" end="00:36:58.416" style="s2">We&#39;re going to make her pay.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.516" end="00:37:00.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.516" end="00:37:02.316" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.716" end="00:37:05.416" style="s2">Can we have the wedding first? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.316" end="00:37:06.616" style="s2">scared. I&#39;m afraid someone will stop us.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.416" end="00:37:08.416" style="s2">I just wanted to become your wife as</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.616" end="00:37:10.016" style="s2">soon as possible, even if the Sanguini</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.416" end="00:37:11.816" style="s2">family never recognizes it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.016" end="00:37:13.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t let them go see Celine. The</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.816" end="00:37:14.716" style="s2">second they see her in a not wedding</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.116" end="00:37:16.416" style="s2">dress, they&#39;ll waver.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.716" end="00:37:17.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. We&#39;ll go to the church now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.416" end="00:37:18.516" style="s2">The five of us will marry you today, and</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.616" end="00:37:19.916" style="s2">no one will stop us.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.516" end="00:37:21.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. We won&#39;t go back to the manor.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.916" end="00:37:22.316" style="s2">We&#39;ll go straight to Blackstone Chapel.</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.116" end="00:37:24.516" style="s2">It&#39;s remote. No one will bother us</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.316" end="00:37:24.516" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.020" end="00:37:28.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.116" end="00:37:40.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cece, I stole this gem from Father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.916" end="00:37:42.716" style="s2">vault. Look, doesn&#39;t it look just like</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.616" end="00:37:45.516" style="s2">your eyes? It&#39;s yours. When I grow up,</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.716" end="00:37:45.516" style="s2">I&#39;m going to marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.816" end="00:37:55.516" style="s2">Cece, this bracelet is made from the</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.916" end="00:37:56.816" style="s2">baby fangs the five of us shed.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.516" end="00:38:00.016" style="s2">Wear it,</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.816" end="00:38:00.016" style="s2">and we&#39;ll always protect you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.516" end="00:38:07.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, I don&#39;t need any of this.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.016" end="00:38:09.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celilian, the car is ready. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.716" end="00:38:11.216" style="s2">time to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.716" end="00:38:13.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.216" end="00:38:14.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Master Damian and the others still</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.116" end="00:38:15.716" style="s2">aren&#39;t back.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.516" end="00:38:16.816" style="s2">Are you really leaving without saying</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.716" end="00:38:19.516" style="s2">goodbye?</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.816" end="00:38:20.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re already over.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.516" end="00:38:22.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, I watched you grow up with all</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.716" end="00:38:24.116" style="s2">five young masters.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.316" end="00:38:25.016" style="s2">You used to be so close. It&#39;s a shame</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.116" end="00:38:26.936" style="s2">things came to this.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.016" end="00:38:30.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hank, everyone has to move forward.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.936" end="00:38:30.116" style="s2">[music] It&#39;s time for me to go.</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.716" end="00:38:48.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Under the of eternal</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.017" end="00:38:54.517" style="s2">Miss Morgana Cravelt,</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.717" end="00:38:56.617" style="s2">do you take these five gentlemen as your</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.517" end="00:38:58.317" style="s2">husbands to remain by their side in</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.617" end="00:38:58.917" style="s2">poverty or wealth, in sickness or</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.317" end="00:39:01.617" style="s2">health?</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.917" end="00:39:03.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do. I absolutely do.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.617" end="00:39:05.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Damian Sanguis,</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.617" end="00:39:07.717" style="s2">do you take Miss Morgania Cravelt as</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.617" end="00:39:08.817" style="s2">your wife, whether</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.717" end="00:39:10.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian,</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.817" end="00:39:11.817" style="s2">say you do.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.017" end="00:39:14.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Damian</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.817" end="00:39:15.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why am I thinking about Celine? Morgana</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.117" end="00:39:17.817" style="s2">is the woman I&#39;m about to marry.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.917" end="00:39:20.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, [music] Celine still hasn&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.817" end="00:39:22.417" style="s2">to apologize. What if she really doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.017" end="00:39:24.517" style="s2">care about us anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.417" end="00:39:26.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.517" end="00:39:27.917" style="s2">Celine&#39;s just scared.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.617" end="00:39:29.717" style="s2">She&#39;s afraid we won&#39;t forgive her, so</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.917" end="00:39:32.717" style="s2">she doesn&#39;t dare come.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.717" end="00:39:35.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop thinking about Selilia.</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.717" end="00:39:38.317" style="s2">We&#39;re marrying Morgana right now.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.117" end="00:39:38.317" style="s2">Get your head straight.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.297" end="00:39:43.317" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.317" end="00:39:46.817" style="s2">Young master Damian,</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.317" end="00:39:46.817" style="s2">Miss Celine is leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.217" end="00:39:52.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make us bow our heads.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.317" end="00:39:55.417" style="s2">Does she think pretending to leave will</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.917" end="00:39:56.817" style="s2">make us run back and beg her to stay?</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.417" end="00:39:58.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.817" end="00:39:59.917" style="s2">Celine would never leave us. Who else</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.917" end="00:40:02.017" style="s2">would want her?</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.917" end="00:40:03.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s another performance. Last time she</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.017" end="00:40:04.817" style="s2">pretended to faint. Now she&#39;s pretending</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.517" end="00:40:06.497" style="s2">to run away. Can&#39;t she come up with</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.817" end="00:40:08.517" style="s2">anything</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.497" end="00:40:08.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.517" end="00:40:13.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, I&#39;m scared.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.517" end="00:40:15.917" style="s2">What if she comes to ruin our wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.717" end="00:40:17.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be afraid. I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.917" end="00:40:19.017" style="s2">She wouldn&#39;t dare.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.517" end="00:40:20.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Selilia is really leaving. Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.017" end="00:40:21.917" style="s2">Sanguini has the family guards escorting</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.617" end="00:40:23.817" style="s2">her out right now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.917" end="00:40:25.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hank, are you senile? Where could she</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.817" end="00:40:27.117" style="s2">possibly go? There&#39;s no one left in the</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.317" end="00:40:29.717" style="s2">Moretti family. Don&#39;t tell me you fell</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.117" end="00:40:31.217" style="s2">for Celine&#39;s poor little me act, too.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.717" end="00:40:33.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Selilia is going to Black Harbor</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.217" end="00:40:35.017" style="s2">Estate. She&#39;s engaged to Lord Lucian</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.317" end="00:40:38.317" style="s2">Knott. She announced it at the family</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.017" end="00:40:38.317" style="s2">council three days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.717" end="00:40:42.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucian Knott?</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.917" end="00:40:46.717" style="s2">500-year-old Lucian Knott?</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.117" end="00:40:48.017" style="s2">Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.717" end="00:40:48.917" style="s2">How would Celine even know someone like</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.017" end="00:40:51.038" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.917" end="00:40:51.318" style="s2">She barely ever leaves the manor.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.038" end="00:40:52.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.318" end="00:40:54.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Knott family already sent their</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.818" end="00:40:56.118" style="s2">crowned.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.218" end="00:40:58.418" style="s2">If you go back now, you may still catch</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.118" end="00:41:01.318" style="s2">Ms. Celine one last time. Any later and</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.418" end="00:41:01.318" style="s2">you&#39;ll really miss her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.483" end="00:41:05.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.718" end="00:41:09.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to see what game she&#39;s playing.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.818" end="00:41:09.318" style="s2">If she&#39;s lying, I won&#39;t forgive her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.033" end="00:41:12.053" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying]</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.928" end="00:41:18.318" style="s2">[panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.618" end="00:41:20.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, darling,</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.318" end="00:41:22.518" style="s2">can we finish the ceremony first? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.018" end="00:41:22.518" style="s2">scared.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.018" end="00:41:26.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have to teach Celine a lesson first.</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.118" end="00:41:27.618" style="s2">Otherwise, after we&#39;re married, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.218" end="00:41:28.618" style="s2">only come up with worse ways to torment</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.618" end="00:41:29.918" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.618" end="00:41:31.018" style="s2">Morgana, wait here.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.918" end="00:41:33.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll be quick. We&#39;ll deal with her and</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.018" end="00:41:33.618" style="s2">come right back.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.418" end="00:41:38.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine, you ruined everything again.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.418" end="00:41:45.618" style="s2">You want to make it to Black Harbor</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.718" end="00:41:48.618" style="s2">Estate, Celine?</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.618" end="00:41:48.618" style="s2">Not if I can [music] help it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.718" end="00:42:03.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Patriarch, the young masters still</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.018" end="00:42:04.818" style="s2">haven&#39;t returned. They&#39;re at Blackstone</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.618" end="00:42:07.218" style="s2">Chapel holding a wedding with Ms.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.818" end="00:42:07.218" style="s2">Morgana.</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.118" end="00:42:11.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call those five animals young</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.718" end="00:42:13.418" style="s2">masters anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.718" end="00:42:15.218" style="s2">After Celine&#39;s wedding, I&#39;ll formally</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.418" end="00:42:17.418" style="s2">disown every one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.218" end="00:42:17.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.918" end="00:42:23.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CC,</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.218" end="00:42:23.518" style="s2">do you want to see them one last time?</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.018" end="00:42:27.318" style="s2">Think of it as a final goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.618" end="00:42:32.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need, August.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.218" end="00:42:32.418" style="s2">I won&#39;t keep Lucian waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.620" end="00:43:10.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was wearing a wedding dress.</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.320" end="00:43:15.320" style="s2">Why would she leave in a wedding dress?</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.820" end="00:43:16.520" style="s2">That dress,</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.320" end="00:43:17.920" style="s2">wasn&#39;t it supposed to be for our</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.520" end="00:43:19.620" style="s2">wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.920" end="00:43:22.420" style="s2">Where is she going? Why is she leaving</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.620" end="00:43:22.420" style="s2">Sanguinetti Manor?</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.720" end="00:43:29.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is she going?</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.620" end="00:43:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To Black Harbor Estate, young master</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.120" end="00:43:31.520" style="s2">Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.720" end="00:43:36.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare lie to me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.420" end="00:43:37.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the family council, Miss Celine was</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.120" end="00:43:39.220" style="s2">about to announce it,</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.820" end="00:43:40.720" style="s2">but you left early carrying Miss</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.220" end="00:43:42.520" style="s2">Morgana.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.720" end="00:43:44.620" style="s2">After you left, she put on the Knot</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.520" end="00:43:46.520" style="s2">Blood Crystal ring in front of everyone</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.620" end="00:43:49.320" style="s2">and announced that Lord Lucius Knot was</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.520" end="00:43:49.320" style="s2">her fiance.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.920" end="00:43:57.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That day,</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.620" end="00:43:58.920" style="s2">did we leave too early?</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.520" end="00:44:00.520" style="s2">She couldn&#39;t even hold on to the five of</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.920" end="00:44:01.620" style="s2">us, and now she thinks she can reach</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.520" end="00:44:02.920" style="s2">Lucian?</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.620" end="00:44:04.620" style="s2">Give me a break.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.920" end="00:44:07.320" style="s2">She&#39;s just trying to save face.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.620" end="00:44:10.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Who would marry her? A woman</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.320" end="00:44:11.720" style="s2">who fakes blindness, plays helpless, and</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.020" end="00:44:14.120" style="s2">cries all day?</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.720" end="00:44:15.920" style="s2">Hank, that&#39;s just your word. Why should</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.120" end="00:44:17.920" style="s2">we believe you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.920" end="00:44:19.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young masters, believe me this once. The</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.920" end="00:44:20.720" style="s2">convoy hasn&#39;t gone far. If you chase</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.520" end="00:44:22.120" style="s2">them now, you may still catch them at</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.720" end="00:44:24.320" style="s2">the highway. Wait any longer and it&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.120" end="00:44:27.520" style="s2">really be too late.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.320" end="00:44:27.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare lie to me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.120" end="00:44:33.420" style="s2">You were bought off by Celine too.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.020" end="00:44:35.420" style="s2">You&#39;re helping her lie to us, aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.420" end="00:44:38.020" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.420" end="00:44:39.820" style="s2">What did she promise you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.020" end="00:44:41.820" style="s2">Did she tell you to wait here so we</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.820" end="00:44:42.620" style="s2">chase after her and beg her to come</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.820" end="00:44:44.220" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.620" end="00:44:45.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly it. You planned this</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.220" end="00:44:49.320" style="s2">whole thing to stop us from marrying</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.520" end="00:44:49.320" style="s2">Morgana. What did Celilia give you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.020" end="00:44:55.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I swear she gave me nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.120" end="00:44:58.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young master, I</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.121" end="00:45:01.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just an old gatekeeper.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.121" end="00:45:01.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, calm down.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.821" end="00:45:06.321" style="s2">If it&#39;s a lie, we&#39;ll catch up and expose</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.721" end="00:45:06.321" style="s2">her ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.721" end="00:45:09.421" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.821" end="00:45:10.821" style="s2">We&#39;ll see it with our own eyes. If</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.421" end="00:45:13.721" style="s2">Celine is playing games, we&#39;ll expose</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.821" end="00:45:13.721" style="s2">her in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.621" end="00:45:19.621" style="s2">You&#39;ll see the second we catch up,</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.321" end="00:45:19.621" style="s2">she&#39;ll throw herself at us crying.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.021" end="00:45:30.221" style="s2">Celine, you would never leave me. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.221" end="00:45:32.321" style="s2">just angry. How could you marry someone</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.221" end="00:45:34.021" style="s2">else? How dare you marry someone else?</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.321" end="00:45:35.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, she&#39;s only wearing that wedding</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.021" end="00:45:39.421" style="s2">dress to make us jealous, right? She</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.721" end="00:45:39.421" style="s2">can&#39;t ACTUALLY BE MARRYING SOMEONE ELSE.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.021" end="00:46:02.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CELINE, are you done with this tantrum?</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.221" end="00:46:04.721" style="s2">The The wedding dress, the ring,</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.921" end="00:46:06.121" style="s2">dragging Lucius&#39;s name into it. You</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.721" end="00:46:07.321" style="s2">think any of that will make me regret</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.121" end="00:46:09.621" style="s2">anything?</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.321" end="00:46:10.821" style="s2">What is this supposed to be?</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.621" end="00:46:14.021" style="s2">You dress up like that and suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.821" end="00:46:16.321" style="s2">think one of us is going to marry you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.021" end="00:46:17.721" style="s2">Celine, you&#39;re not a child anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.321" end="00:46:20.921" style="s2">Putting on a pretty dress and pretending</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.721" end="00:46:20.921" style="s2">to run away is embarrassing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.221" end="00:46:26.921" style="s2">Hey, get out of the car.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.321" end="00:46:30.621" style="s2">Come to the church with us and you can</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.921" end="00:46:30.621" style="s2">watch us marry Morgana yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.021" end="00:46:36.621" style="s2">Stop wasting everyone&#39;s time.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.121" end="00:46:38.421" style="s2">Are you getting out on your own or do we</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.621" end="00:46:40.221" style="s2">have to drag you out?</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.421" end="00:46:43.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say you&#39;d never marry me? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.221" end="00:46:43.721" style="s2">giving you exactly what you wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.721" end="00:46:53.421" style="s2">I&#39;m marrying someone else, so why are</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.721" end="00:46:56.421" style="s2">you blocking my car?</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.421" end="00:46:56.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still pretending.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.721" end="00:47:01.723" style="s2">You five animals still have the nerve to</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.223" end="00:47:02.922" style="s2">show your faces. Who gave you the</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.723" end="00:47:04.723" style="s2">courage to block my car?</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.922" end="00:47:07.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, you shot me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.723" end="00:47:07.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make me clean house.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.023" end="00:47:13.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve stopped caring about what you did</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.223" end="00:47:15.323" style="s2">to me before.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.723" end="00:47:16.922" style="s2">Now move aside and let me go to Black</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.323" end="00:47:18.323" style="s2">Harbor Estate.</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.922" end="00:47:21.922" style="s2">I have to get there before sunrise and</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.323" end="00:47:21.922" style="s2">leave Italy with Lucian&#39;s envoy.</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.122" end="00:47:25.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.622" end="00:47:28.823" style="s2">Lucian not doesn&#39;t even answer to the</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.122" end="00:47:30.823" style="s2">Elder Council. Why would he marry you?</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.823" end="00:47:32.323" style="s2">Celine, you&#39;re so desperate to make me</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.823" end="00:47:33.122" style="s2">bow that you&#39;d lie about something like</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.323" end="00:47:34.723" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.122" end="00:47:35.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only if Lucian were blind.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.723" end="00:47:38.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe he is.</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.823" end="00:47:39.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine, come back with us.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.323" end="00:47:42.823" style="s2">Stop performing. You&#39;re only making us</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.922" end="00:47:42.823" style="s2">respect you less.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.523" end="00:47:47.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not lying.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.223" end="00:47:49.223" style="s2">Believe me or don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.823" end="00:47:51.523" style="s2">I&#39;m leaving now.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.223" end="00:47:51.523" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.523" end="00:47:56.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I truly don&#39;t know how I managed to</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.922" end="00:47:58.023" style="s2">raise five spectacular idiots.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.523" end="00:48:00.122" style="s2">You&#39;d rather trust a half-breed liar</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.023" end="00:48:01.723" style="s2">than the sister you grew up with.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.122" end="00:48:03.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, stop indulging Celine&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.723" end="00:48:04.723" style="s2">nonsense. We&#39;re busy. Morgana is waiting</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.523" end="00:48:06.122" style="s2">at the church for us to go back and</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.723" end="00:48:08.422" style="s2">marry her. Do you have any idea she</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.122" end="00:48:08.422" style="s2">almost</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.523" end="00:48:12.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, VAMPIRE HUNTERS ARE COMING.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.622" end="00:48:31.523" style="s2">PROTECT CELINE.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.823" end="00:48:41.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU FIVE, GET CELINE OUT OF HERE NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.622" end="00:48:42.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FATHER, I&#39;M STAYING. I&#39;M FIGHTING BESIDE</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.523" end="00:48:44.323" style="s2">YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.622" end="00:48:46.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S AN ORDER. Take Celine to Black</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.323" end="00:48:48.538" style="s2">Port Manor now. The Sanguines do not</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.122" end="00:48:49.523" style="s2">break their word. DO YOU HEAR ME?</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.538" end="00:48:51.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.523" end="00:48:52.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARE YOU INSANE?</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.122" end="00:48:54.122" style="s2">IF WE DON&#39;T LEAVE NOW, WE&#39;RE ALL GOING</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.422" end="00:48:58.223" style="s2">TO DIE HERE.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.122" end="00:48:58.223" style="s2">And if you die, what happens to Morgana?</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.324" end="00:49:13.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on tight.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.724" end="00:49:15.724" style="s2">If you fall off, I&#39;M NOT COMING BACK FOR</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.524" end="00:49:15.724" style="s2">YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.024" end="00:49:35.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AUGUST!</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.324" end="00:49:48.324" style="s2">DAMIAN, NO. IT&#39;S THE OTHER WAY.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.724" end="00:49:48.324" style="s2">BLACKPORT MANOR IS TO THE RIGHT.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.824" end="00:49:53.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HAVEN&#39;T YOU CAUSED enough trouble</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.124" end="00:49:53.524" style="s2">already?</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.424" end="00:49:57.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine, how long are you going to keep</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.324" end="00:49:58.524" style="s2">this act up? Father almost died back</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.124" end="00:50:00.124" style="s2">there because of this ridiculous runaway</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.524" end="00:50:01.224" style="s2">stunt of yours. He&#39;s surrounded by</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.124" end="00:50:02.424" style="s2">vampire hunters right now. We don&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.224" end="00:50:04.524" style="s2">know if he&#39;s alive. Are you HAPPY NOW?</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.424" end="00:50:05.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS IS ALL YOUR FAULT.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.524" end="00:50:07.224" style="s2">AND you made us miss our wedding to</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.624" end="00:50:08.524" style="s2">Morgana. She&#39;s all alone at the church</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.224" end="00:50:09.924" style="s2">right now. God knows how hard she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.524" end="00:50:11.124" style="s2">crying. You only ever think about</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.924" end="00:50:14.224" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.124" end="00:50:14.224" style="s2">You&#39;re selfish and vicious.</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.924" end="00:50:18.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since the family council, you&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.524" end="00:50:19.424" style="s2">strangers to me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.024" end="00:50:21.224" style="s2">I haven&#39;t cared about you or Morgana</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.424" end="00:50:23.524" style="s2">since then. You got me out of there just</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.224" end="00:50:25.124" style="s2">now, and I&#39;m grateful. Now please honor</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.524" end="00:50:27.324" style="s2">father&#39;s order and take me to Blackport</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.124" end="00:50:29.424" style="s2">Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.324" end="00:50:31.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Strangers? Isn&#39;t it a little late to say</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.424" end="00:50:33.524" style="s2">that now? Blackport Manor? You really</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.624" end="00:50:35.424" style="s2">expect us to believe that? No one&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.524" end="00:50:38.124" style="s2">lived there in decades. Why would anyone</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.424" end="00:50:38.124" style="s2">send you there?</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.924" end="00:50:44.424" style="s2">Celine, stop fooling yourself. There is</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.224" end="00:50:46.024" style="s2">no wedding. There is no Lucian. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.424" end="00:50:49.924" style="s2">not going anywhere today. You&#39;re coming</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.024" end="00:50:49.924" style="s2">back with us and apologizing to Morgana.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.370" end="00:50:52.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.524" end="00:50:54.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, for the sake of everything we</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.224" end="00:50:56.124" style="s2">grew up through together, please. Just</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.124" end="00:50:59.624" style="s2">this once, help me. I have to reach</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.124" end="00:50:59.624" style="s2">Blackport Manor before sunrise.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.424" end="00:51:03.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t try that on me. You just want to</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.725" end="00:51:06.425" style="s2">stop us from marrying McGana.</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.925" end="00:51:08.425" style="s2">Celine, you&#39;ve disappointed me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.425" end="00:51:09.825" style="s2">We&#39;re not falling for this again.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.425" end="00:51:11.625" style="s2">You made up this whole story just to</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.825" end="00:51:14.025" style="s2">keep us tied to you, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.625" end="00:51:17.025" style="s2">We&#39;re done. If you want to go so badly,</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.025" end="00:51:17.025" style="s2">walk there yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.925" end="00:51:27.725" style="s2">Should we maybe follow her? We&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.025" end="00:51:29.925" style="s2">far from the city. What if she runs into</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.725" end="00:51:29.925" style="s2">Hunter?</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.225" end="00:51:40.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, Adrian, help me. I&#39;m scared.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.225" end="00:51:45.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well, if it isn&#39;t the young</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.125" end="00:51:46.325" style="s2">masters of House Sanguiri. What</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.125" end="00:51:48.725" style="s2">unfortunate timing.</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.325" end="00:51:49.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Helsing, if you want someone, take me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.725" end="00:51:51.225" style="s2">LET HER GO.</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.625" end="00:51:53.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which her? Oh, you mean this little</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.225" end="00:51:54.725" style="s2">mongrel? You seem awfully attached to</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.225" end="00:51:56.025" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.725" end="00:51:58.490" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.025" end="00:51:59.525" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you a choice.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.490" end="00:52:00.925" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.525" end="00:52:02.225" style="s2">On this side,</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.925" end="00:52:03.425" style="s2">the saintess you&#39;ve known since</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.225" end="00:52:04.925" style="s2">childhood.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.425" end="00:52:07.005" style="s2">On that side,</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.925" end="00:52:08.825" style="s2">the mongrel you love.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.005" end="00:52:10.225" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.825" end="00:52:12.325" style="s2">Pick one.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.225" end="00:52:15.125" style="s2">I let one go,</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.325" end="00:52:15.125" style="s2">the other dies.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.925" end="00:52:25.125" style="s2">Made your decision?</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.525" end="00:52:27.125" style="s2">Because I&#39;m about to pull the trigger.</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.125" end="00:52:28.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, save me. I don&#39;t want to die. We</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.125" end="00:52:29.925" style="s2">haven&#39;t even had our wedding YET. YOU</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.325" end="00:52:32.425" style="s2">PROMISED YOU&#39;D PROTECT me forever.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.925" end="00:52:34.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, what will you choose? I think I</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.425" end="00:52:37.625" style="s2">already know.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.325" end="00:52:37.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, DON&#39;T HURT CELINE.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.325" end="00:52:43.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those five idiots still can&#39;t let Celine</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.325" end="00:52:44.725" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.425" end="00:52:47.325" style="s2">I can&#39;t give them another second to</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.725" end="00:52:47.325" style="s2">hesitate.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.925" end="00:52:51.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.825" end="00:52:52.125" style="s2">so you&#39;ve decided to let the mongrel</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.025" end="00:52:53.125" style="s2">die.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.125" end="00:52:54.025" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.125" end="00:52:58.925" style="s2">I&#39;ll make it happen.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.025" end="00:53:00.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, Adrian, Blake, Marcus, Grayson.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.925" end="00:53:03.525" style="s2">I really do love you. I&#39;d give</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.725" end="00:53:05.327" style="s2">everything for you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.525" end="00:53:06.727" style="s2">If my death is what it takes for you to</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.327" end="00:53:10.127" style="s2">be happy,</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.727" end="00:53:11.727" style="s2">then I&#39;ll die willingly. I only wish</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.127" end="00:53:14.327" style="s2">I could have truly become your bride</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.727" end="00:53:14.327" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.727" end="00:53:19.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celia is the saintess.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.527" end="00:53:21.027" style="s2">Her blood can heal almost anything. She</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.727" end="00:53:23.227" style="s2">won&#39;t die.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.027" end="00:53:25.027" style="s2">Even if she&#39;s shot, she&#39;ll recover.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.227" end="00:53:26.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But that&#39;s the philosopher&#39;s stone.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.027" end="00:53:28.427" style="s2">It&#39;s said to kill even Dragon Win. Are</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.827" end="00:53:29.927" style="s2">you sure she can survive it?</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.427" end="00:53:31.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Helsing is a liar. Maybe he&#39;s bluffing.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.927" end="00:53:31.427" style="s2">It could just be an ordinary silver</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.227" end="00:53:32.227" style="s2">round.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.427" end="00:53:33.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what if it really is the</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.227" end="00:53:36.327" style="s2">philosopher&#39;s stone? What if she</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.327" end="00:53:36.327" style="s2">actually dies?</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.927" end="00:53:40.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She won&#39;t die.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.727" end="00:53:43.127" style="s2">How could she? Think about everything</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.527" end="00:53:44.427" style="s2">she&#39;s survived since we were kids.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.127" end="00:53:45.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dawn&#39;s coming.</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.427" end="00:53:48.227" style="s2">I don&#39;t have time to sit through your</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.627" end="00:53:50.227" style="s2">little tragedy. Have you chosen or not?</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.227" end="00:53:51.927" style="s2">Keep stalling and I&#39;ll kill THEM BOTH.</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.227" end="00:53:54.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MORGANA! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.927" end="00:53:54.627" style="s2">MORGANA!</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.227" end="00:54:02.997" style="s2">GIVE MORGANA BACK TO US.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.977" end="00:54:02.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.027" end="00:54:07.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AS YOU WISH.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.147" end="00:54:13.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.127" end="00:54:14.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DAMIAN,</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.327" end="00:54:16.427" style="s2">my love.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.927" end="00:54:19.027" style="s2">I thought I was going to lose all of you</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.427" end="00:54:19.027" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.927" end="00:54:27.027" style="s2">Decades together,</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.827" end="00:54:27.027" style="s2">and it was all a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.797" end="00:54:31.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.227" end="00:54:39.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, it&#39;s too late. We have to go.</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.727" end="00:54:40.927" style="s2">The sun&#39;s coming up. Once daylight hits,</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.527" end="00:54:43.627" style="s2">we&#39;ll all burn. We need to get out of</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.927" end="00:54:43.627" style="s2">here first.</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.583" end="00:55:02.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.827" end="00:55:12.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are red eyes. She&#39;s awakened. The</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.928" end="00:55:12.828" style="s2">pretender bloodline.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.528" end="00:55:31.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you permission to point that</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.928" end="00:55:31.028" style="s2">thing at my fiancee?</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.928" end="00:55:42.828" style="s2">So you&#39;re the five who have been hurting</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.528" end="00:55:42.828" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.928" end="00:55:57.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them go.</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.828" end="00:55:57.828" style="s2">They&#39;ll get what they deserve.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.428" end="00:56:11.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.974" end="00:56:32.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.524" end="00:56:40.028" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.128" end="00:56:43.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.028" end="00:56:43.228" style="s2">What&#39;s happening to all of you?</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.528" end="00:56:50.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Selilia is punishing us</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.028" end="00:56:52.328" style="s2">because we didn&#39;t choose her.</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.624" end="00:56:54.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.328" end="00:56:57.174" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These five losers are useless to me now.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.828" end="00:56:58.528" style="s2">I need to find a way to ditch them.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.174" end="00:57:00.528" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.528" end="00:57:01.728" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid. Selilian must have</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.528" end="00:57:03.528" style="s2">cursed you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.728" end="00:57:06.628" style="s2">I know a sorcerer in a nearby city. He</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.528" end="00:57:06.628" style="s2">can break any curse.</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.928" end="00:57:09.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.828" end="00:57:11.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.828" end="00:57:13.229" style="s2">Look at you. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.129" end="00:57:15.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ordinary people see you like this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.229" end="00:57:16.129" style="s2">Wait here. I&#39;ll go bring the sorcerer</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.129" end="00:57:17.029" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.129" end="00:57:20.229" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.029" end="00:57:20.229" style="s2">his price is very high.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.129" end="00:57:27.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take all of this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.529" end="00:57:31.729" style="s2">Just hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.729" end="00:57:31.729" style="s2">Come back fast. We&#39;ll wait for you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.729" end="00:57:41.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop right there.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.629" end="00:57:50.929" style="s2">Father.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.929" end="00:57:52.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have no son stupid enough to shame me</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.929" end="00:57:54.229" style="s2">like this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.629" end="00:57:55.829" style="s2">The Sangenini family has never hunted</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.229" end="00:57:57.929" style="s2">humans and vampire hunters have never</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.829" end="00:58:00.229" style="s2">targeted us like this. Ever since you</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.929" end="00:58:02.129" style="s2">brought that mongrel into our estate,</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.229" end="00:58:04.629" style="s2">how many times have we been attacked and</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.129" end="00:58:08.429" style="s2">not one of you thought to suspect her?</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.629" end="00:58:08.429" style="s2">Did you leave your brains to the dogs?</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.929" end="00:58:13.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.729" end="00:58:13.429" style="s2">what are you saying?</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.429" end="00:58:25.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell them the plan</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.329" end="00:58:27.129" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.729" end="00:58:29.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She promised us that if we helped her</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.129" end="00:58:31.029" style="s2">get rid of Celine, she&#39;d lead us into</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.329" end="00:58:33.429" style="s2">the Sangenini estate so we could wipe</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.029" end="00:58:35.129" style="s2">out your entire family.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.429" end="00:58:36.729" style="s2">The attack at the service place,</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.129" end="00:58:40.229" style="s2">tonight&#39;s ambush,</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.729" end="00:58:40.229" style="s2">she tipped us off both times.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.829" end="00:58:44.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What he said,</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.429" end="00:58:47.929" style="s2">is it true?</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.829" end="00:58:50.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We trusted you so completely.</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.929" end="00:58:52.329" style="s2">And because of you, we hurt Celine again</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.029" end="00:58:54.929" style="s2">and again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.329" end="00:58:56.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We cursed her, hit her,</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.929" end="00:58:58.429" style="s2">stabbed her, even tried to cut out her</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.829" end="00:59:00.315" style="s2">heart.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.429" end="00:59:01.829" style="s2">All because of you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.315" end="00:59:06.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.829" end="00:59:06.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lied TO US FROM THE VERY BEGINNING.</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.229" end="00:59:18.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you finished?</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.031" end="00:59:20.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.131" end="00:59:22.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I lied to you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.631" end="00:59:25.331" style="s2">So what? You were stupid enough to let</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.631" end="00:59:26.831" style="s2">me play all five of you like fools.</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.331" end="00:59:29.031" style="s2">And now you&#39;ve broken Celine&#39;s heart</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.831" end="00:59:31.231" style="s2">beyond repair. Even if you finally know</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.031" end="00:59:31.931" style="s2">the truth, what does it change? You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.231" end="00:59:32.831" style="s2">stupid enough to let all five of you</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.931" end="00:59:35.031" style="s2">like fools and I broke Celine&#39;s heart</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.831" end="00:59:35.031" style="s2">beyond</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.131" end="00:59:50.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You betrayed Celine and the curse has</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.831" end="00:59:51.531" style="s2">begun to turn on you. On the night of</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.431" end="00:59:54.031" style="s2">the lunar eclipse, you&#39;ll become</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.531" end="00:59:55.831" style="s2">mindless bat-beasts forever. I, August</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.031" end="00:59:57.731" style="s2">San Gini, have no sons from this day</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.831" end="01:00:00.731" style="s2">forward. You are never to return to the</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.731" end="01:00:00.731" style="s2">San Gini estate.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.931" end="01:00:12.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was me. I did this to her.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.431" end="01:00:13.731" style="s2">We all deserve this. She told us. She</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.031" end="01:00:14.631" style="s2">told us so many times and none of us</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.731" end="01:00:16.431" style="s2">believed her.</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.631" end="01:00:17.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This has to be a nightmare.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.431" end="01:00:18.931" style="s2">Maybe.</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.231" end="01:00:20.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could we ever have done something so</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.931" end="01:00:23.731" style="s2">cruel to Celine?</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.331" end="01:00:23.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine will never forgive us.</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.831" end="01:00:33.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to Blackport Manor.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.231" end="01:00:37.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.631" end="01:00:40.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to apologize to Celine.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.731" end="01:00:42.331" style="s2">Even if we&#39;re doomed to become bats, she</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.031" end="01:00:45.431" style="s2">needs to know that we finally understand</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.331" end="01:00:45.431" style="s2">how wrong we were.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.831" end="01:01:06.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.231" end="01:01:09.931" style="s2">just you here?</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.731" end="01:01:09.931" style="s2">Where is Lucian Not?</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.631" end="01:01:16.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t recognize me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.531" end="01:01:16.332" style="s2">Just as innocent and as ever.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.232" end="01:01:21.632" style="s2">Lord Nott has returned to the Nott</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.532" end="01:01:22.932" style="s2">estate to prepare for the wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.632" end="01:01:24.232" style="s2">He ordered me to stay here and look</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.932" end="01:01:27.692" style="s2">after you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.232" end="01:01:28.432" style="s2">In three days, I&#39;ll escort you to him.</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.692" end="01:01:30.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.432" end="01:01:32.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re his butler. Thank you for</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.332" end="01:01:34.232" style="s2">saving me back there.</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.032" end="01:01:38.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was my duty. You&#39;re the future Lady</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.232" end="01:01:38.132" style="s2">Nott. Protecting you is my honor.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.232" end="01:01:46.632" style="s2">Great Lord Lucifer,</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.832" end="01:01:48.632" style="s2">please bless my bride.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.632" end="01:01:51.832" style="s2">Keep all misfortune from her</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.632" end="01:01:55.032" style="s2">and let her never shed another tear.</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.832" end="01:01:55.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have we met somewhere before?</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.532" end="01:02:02.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is my lady flirting with me</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.232" end="01:02:02.132" style="s2">or am I simply too handsome to ignore?</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.332" end="01:02:09.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please show some respect when you speak</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.932" end="01:02:09.032" style="s2">to me. I&#39;m your master&#39;s fiance.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.432" end="01:02:18.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My master clearly has no idea how</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.232" end="01:02:18.532" style="s2">adorable his fiance is.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.332" end="01:02:38.832" style="s2">Get some rest.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.632" end="01:02:38.832" style="s2">Call for me if you need anything.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.432" end="01:02:48.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still don&#39;t know your name.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.032" end="01:02:53.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luke.</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.332" end="01:02:54.832" style="s2">You may call me Luke.</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.332" end="01:02:57.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luke,</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.832" end="01:02:59.432" style="s2">thank you for yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.332" end="01:03:02.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to thank me, Miss Celine.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.432" end="01:03:02.432" style="s2">I was only doing what I should.</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.432" end="01:03:19.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luke, Luke, have to take such good care</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.933" end="01:03:19.233" style="s2">of me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.333" end="01:03:22.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s what I should do.</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.433" end="01:03:25.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do I always feel so strangely close</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.933" end="01:03:25.333" style="s2">to him?</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.333" end="01:03:30.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Celine,</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.133" end="01:03:34.033" style="s2">you&#39;ve been staring at me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.933" end="01:03:34.033" style="s2">Have I charmed you already?</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.533" end="01:03:40.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I wasn&#39;t staring.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.233" end="01:03:40.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I suppose I was flattering myself.</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.433" end="01:03:52.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luke, you shouldn&#39;t treat me this way.</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.033" end="01:03:52.333" style="s2">I&#39;m already promised to someone.</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.533" end="01:03:56.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right, my lady.</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.033" end="01:03:58.433" style="s2">I crossed a line.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.533" end="01:04:00.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you angry with me?</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.433" end="01:04:02.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t dare.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.133" end="01:04:03.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I&#39;m still promised to Lucian not.</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.533" end="01:04:04.533" style="s2">How could I possibly fall for his</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.833" end="01:04:08.733" style="s2">butler?</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.533" end="01:04:08.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My love, let&#39;s see what you choose.</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.933" end="01:04:29.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, there&#39;s a monster outside.</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.633" end="01:04:31.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Celine sees me like this,</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.433" end="01:04:32.833" style="s2">will she run from me too? She&#39;s at</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.133" end="01:04:34.933" style="s2">Blackport Manor now, sleeping in a soft</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.833" end="01:04:37.033" style="s2">bed beside a warm fire. And us?</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.933" end="01:04:39.033" style="s2">We&#39;re nothing but five stray dogs.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.033" end="01:04:41.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We deserved it. We deserved every bit of</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.033" end="01:04:41.333" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.633" end="01:04:46.133" style="s2">Do you remember?</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.633" end="01:04:50.133" style="s2">Back at the Sanguini estate,</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.733" end="01:04:52.333" style="s2">whenever we came back from sword</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.133" end="01:04:55.533" style="s2">practice, Celine always had the kitchen</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.333" end="01:04:57.333" style="s2">save us a bowl of hot soup.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.533" end="01:04:59.833" style="s2">She couldn&#39;t see, but she knew each of</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.333" end="01:05:01.133" style="s2">us by our footsteps.</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.833" end="01:05:02.833" style="s2">We didn&#39;t even have to walk through the</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.133" end="01:05:06.033" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.833" end="01:05:06.033" style="s2">She already knew who was home.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.833" end="01:05:12.333" style="s2">That year I was sick, she stayed by my</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.733" end="01:05:12.333" style="s2">bed for three days and three nights.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.633" end="01:05:16.633" style="s2">I was delirious with fever, holding her</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.333" end="01:05:18.033" style="s2">hand and calling for my mother.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.633" end="01:05:19.835" style="s2">She was younger than me, but she still</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.033" end="01:05:22.935" style="s2">patted my hand and said, it&#39;s okay,</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.835" end="01:05:22.935" style="s2">Blake. I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.435" end="01:05:29.135" style="s2">I regret everything.</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.425" end="01:05:31.035" style="s2">[snorts] It&#39;s too late now.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.135" end="01:05:34.435" style="s2">She&#39;ll never forgive us.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.035" end="01:05:34.435" style="s2">We deserve to become monsters.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.635" end="01:05:47.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Demon. You.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.435" end="01:05:51.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, easy. No need to get so worked up.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.835" end="01:05:51.235" style="s2">I can give you another chance.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.535" end="01:05:59.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here? Come to laugh</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.335" end="01:06:02.835" style="s2">at us?</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.835" end="01:06:05.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here to help you break the curse.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.835" end="01:06:07.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when are you that generous?</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.035" end="01:06:10.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All Celene has to say is, I forgive you</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.435" end="01:06:11.635" style="s2">and the curse is gone. See? Simple.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.535" end="01:06:13.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think we&#39;ll fall for your lies</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.635" end="01:06:15.435" style="s2">again? Back then you traded her eyes to</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.835" end="01:06:17.935" style="s2">restore our human bodies. Now you want</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.435" end="01:06:19.435" style="s2">to use us as pawns to hurt her again?</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.935" end="01:06:21.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurt her?</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.435" end="01:06:23.335" style="s2">How am I hurting her?</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.635" end="01:06:25.335" style="s2">I&#39;m only telling you to apologize and</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.335" end="01:06:27.535" style="s2">ask for forgiveness.</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.335" end="01:06:30.235" style="s2">If she forgives you, you&#39;re saved. If</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.535" end="01:06:33.635" style="s2">she doesn&#39;t, you stay monsters.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.235" end="01:06:35.935" style="s2">What exactly do I gain from that?</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.635" end="01:06:37.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, we&#39;re saved.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.935" end="01:06:38.935" style="s2">Sir Lilia will forgive us.</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.935" end="01:06:40.535" style="s2">She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.935" end="01:06:41.735" style="s2">She&#39;s too kind. She couldn&#39;t even bring</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.535" end="01:06:43.935" style="s2">herself to hurt a rabbit by the</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.735" end="01:06:47.835" style="s2">roadside. If we truly repent, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.935" end="01:06:47.835" style="s2">forgive us. I know she will.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.735" end="01:06:51.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any one of the things we did to her</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.235" end="01:06:54.635" style="s2">would be enough to make her hate us for</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.935" end="01:06:54.635" style="s2">a lifetime.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.035" end="01:07:00.735" style="s2">We even tried to cut out her heart.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.135" end="01:07:04.835" style="s2">How could she possibly forgive us?</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.035" end="01:07:10.835" style="s2">Did you forget?</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.535" end="01:07:12.635" style="s2">When Lucian was going to kill us,</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.835" end="01:07:14.435" style="s2">Celene stopped him.</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.635" end="01:07:16.535" style="s2">If she truly hated us, why would she</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.435" end="01:07:18.335" style="s2">save us? She still cares about us. She</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.535" end="01:07:19.835" style="s2">has to still love us.</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.335" end="01:07:21.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.835" end="01:07:23.236" style="s2">Such a sweet girl.</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.835" end="01:07:25.736" style="s2">After everything you did to her, she</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.236" end="01:07:27.536" style="s2">still couldn&#39;t bear to watch you die.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.736" end="01:07:29.036" style="s2">Makes you wonder,</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.536" end="01:07:30.636" style="s2">is she a fool? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.036" end="01:07:32.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up!</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.636" end="01:07:35.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lunar eclipse is your deadline. Miss</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.836" end="01:07:39.136" style="s2">it and you&#39;ll stay bats forever.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.936" end="01:07:39.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to Blackport Manor.</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.536" end="01:07:48.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.436" end="01:07:55.936" style="s2">I heard you were desperate to see me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.336" end="01:07:58.236" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.936" end="01:08:00.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to end our engagement.</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.236" end="01:08:02.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? Do you find me unworthy?</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.336" end="01:08:04.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, that&#39;s not it. Lord Knott is the</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.936" end="01:08:06.536" style="s2">most powerful vampire king in the world.</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.836" end="01:08:08.436" style="s2">I would never disrespect you, much less</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.536" end="01:08:10.736" style="s2">look down on you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.436" end="01:08:13.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why don&#39;t you want to marry me?</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.736" end="01:08:13.936" style="s2">Is there someone else you love?</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.107" end="01:08:16.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.136" end="01:08:19.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.636" end="01:08:19.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is he?</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.436" end="01:08:24.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I can&#39;t tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.736" end="01:08:25.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.036" end="01:08:27.936" style="s2">If you truly love each other, I can let</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.536" end="01:08:27.936" style="s2">you go.</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.207" end="01:08:32.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.736" end="01:08:32.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Luke, your butler.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.236" end="01:08:37.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? You like me?</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.536" end="01:08:42.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Lucian Knott.</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.736" end="01:08:47.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.636" end="01:08:47.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lied to me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.836" end="01:08:51.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine,</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.936" end="01:08:53.336" style="s2">I never meant to deceive you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.936" end="01:08:56.036" style="s2">I only wanted to see how long it would</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.336" end="01:08:57.536" style="s2">take you to recognize me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.036" end="01:08:59.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have we</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.536" end="01:09:01.036" style="s2">met before?</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.836" end="01:09:03.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes,</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.036" end="01:09:05.336" style="s2">but you probably don&#39;t remember.</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.336" end="01:09:07.136" style="s2">It was a long time ago.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.336" end="01:09:09.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and I were once betrothed. We were</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.136" end="01:09:10.736" style="s2">supposed to marry when you came of age.</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.036" end="01:09:11.836" style="s2">After the Moretti family fell, I lost</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.736" end="01:09:13.936" style="s2">track of you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.836" end="01:09:15.936" style="s2">I searched for a long time. It was only</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.936" end="01:09:17.536" style="s2">recently that I finally found you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.936" end="01:09:18.936" style="s2">Good thing those five little Sanguini</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.536" end="01:09:20.436" style="s2">bastards were too blind to see your</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.936" end="01:09:22.536" style="s2">worth, otherwise</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.436" end="01:09:24.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Otherwise, I would have already married</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.536" end="01:09:26.838" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.636" end="01:09:30.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Otherwise, I would have killed all of</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.838" end="01:09:30.137" style="s2">them and married you anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.438" end="01:09:40.538" style="s2">Celine,</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.137" end="01:09:42.737" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to wait anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.538" end="01:09:44.938" style="s2">I&#39;ve already notified the Sanguinis.</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.737" end="01:09:47.637" style="s2">The moment your adoptive father arrives,</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.938" end="01:09:47.637" style="s2">we&#39;ll be married.</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.938" end="01:10:10.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.338" end="01:10:13.538" style="s2">What are you supposed to be?</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.538" end="01:10:15.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to see Celine Mirado.</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.538" end="01:10:16.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silly lady not.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.137" end="01:10:20.137" style="s2">Have you looked in a mirror?</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.838" end="01:10:20.137" style="s2">What gutter did you crawl out of?</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.738" end="01:10:24.038" style="s2">You don&#39;t look like vampires. You look</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.438" end="01:10:25.838" style="s2">like some filthy cross between goblins</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.038" end="01:10:27.738" style="s2">and imps.</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.838" end="01:10:29.038" style="s2">Don&#39;t start a fight.</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.738" end="01:10:31.338" style="s2">Blackport Manor isn&#39;t a place for</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.038" end="01:10:32.538" style="s2">low-born creatures like you. Get lost</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.338" end="01:10:35.038" style="s2">before you stink up the place for our</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.538" end="01:10:35.038" style="s2">guests.</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.838" end="01:10:53.838" style="s2">We can&#39;t get in.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.038" end="01:10:56.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll wait until she comes out,</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.838" end="01:10:58.938" style="s2">until the wedding is over,</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.137" end="01:11:01.938" style="s2">until the end of time if we have to.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.938" end="01:11:01.938" style="s2">We will see her.</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.338" end="01:11:10.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those five useless idiots are still</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.938" end="01:11:12.438" style="s2">alive. What a pity. Doesn&#39;t matter. Once</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.738" end="01:11:15.038" style="s2">I kill Celine, they can turn to ash for</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.438" end="01:11:15.038" style="s2">all I care.</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.338" end="01:11:26.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This necklace is the same color as your</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.038" end="01:11:26.438" style="s2">eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.339" end="01:11:40.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you thinking about?</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.139" end="01:11:42.744" style="s2">After tomorrow you&#39;ll be mine.</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.639" end="01:11:44.839" style="s2">From then on the only man in your heart</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.744" end="01:11:47.439" style="s2">[music] and the only man you look at</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.839" end="01:11:47.439" style="s2">will be me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.239" end="01:12:04.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the presence of Lord Lucifer</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.639" end="01:12:04.539" style="s2">today we</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.739" end="01:12:11.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine,</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.939" end="01:12:13.239" style="s2">you sanctimonious [ __ ] Why do you get</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.639" end="01:12:15.039" style="s2">to stand here? Why do you get to marry</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.239" end="01:12:16.839" style="s2">the head of land not?</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.039" end="01:12:19.439" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing but a blind woman used</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.839" end="01:12:22.339" style="s2">and discarded by five men, A STRAY</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.439" end="01:12:24.839" style="s2">NOBODY THEY PICKED UP OFF THE STREET.</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.339" end="01:12:26.439" style="s2">I&#39;m prettier than you, smarter than you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.839" end="01:12:28.939" style="s2">I KNOW BETTER THAN YOU HOW TO PLEASE A</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.439" end="01:12:28.939" style="s2">MAN.</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.839" end="01:12:39.239" style="s2">Let me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.685" end="01:13:21.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.239" end="01:13:23.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celine,</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.939" end="01:13:26.139" style="s2">we know we were wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.939" end="01:13:27.239" style="s2">You found happiness and we&#39;re glad for</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.139" end="01:13:29.539" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.239" end="01:13:31.840" style="s2">We only ask that for the sake of all</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.539" end="01:13:34.540" style="s2">those years we grew up together,</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.840" end="01:13:34.540" style="s2">you forgive us.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.840" end="01:13:39.140" style="s2">Celine,</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.140" end="01:13:42.340" style="s2">all you have to do is say you forgive us</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.140" end="01:13:44.740" style="s2">and the curse will be broken.</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.340" end="01:13:48.140" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.740" end="01:13:51.440" style="s2">We&#39;ll never appear before you again.</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.140" end="01:13:51.440" style="s2">Just help us one last time.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.140" end="01:14:00.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave you chances,</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.940" end="01:14:00.740" style="s2">so many of them,</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.540" end="01:14:05.340" style="s2">and you threw away every single one.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.361" end="01:14:17.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.840" end="01:14:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take them away.</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.340" end="01:14:37.740" style="s2">Wash them up and keep them in the back</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.640" end="01:14:41.540" style="s2">garden.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.740" end="01:14:41.540" style="s2">Consider them five pets for my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.940" end="01:14:59.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the name of Lord Lucifer</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.940" end="01:15:01.840" style="s2">and before the spirits of Knotts</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.340" end="01:15:04.340" style="s2">ancestors, the bride and groom shall now</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.840" end="01:15:06.140" style="s2">exchange their vows.</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.340" end="01:15:08.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From this day on, Lucian Knotts is the</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.140" end="01:15:11.040" style="s2">only husband I, Celine, will ever have.</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.840" end="01:15:13.340" style="s2">I&#39;ll stand at your side. If you live, I</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.040" end="01:15:13.340" style="s2">live.</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.840" end="01:15:17.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From this day on, Celine Moretti is the</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.740" end="01:15:18.240" style="s2">only wife I, Lucian Knotts, will ever</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.240" end="01:15:21.540" style="s2">have.</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.240" end="01:15:21.540" style="s2">If you die, I die.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.940" end="01:15:37.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I like I&#39;ve been trapped in a</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.042" end="01:15:39.342" style="s2">nightmare for a very very long time.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.342" end="01:15:42.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From this day on, I will never let</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.342" end="01:15:42.342" style="s2">anyone hurt you again.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
